<br/><br/>Thanks a lot to all those great photographers who gave this week to me, when so many of them were equally deserving.<br/><br/>aldo<br/></td>', 'I am very honored with your comments and congratulations. The result was specially satisfying for me since that week I spent morning after morning dropping my kids at school, and staying in the parking lot chasing an elusive sun light that I was sure would have to hit that mountain sooner or later, but of course I had to have clouds in my morning sky, and those same clouds were covering my sunlight. Finally, the last day, there was a clearing between the clouds, a 30 seconds chance at it, and I was right there, waiting for it. I was noticed by everyone in school the strange father who stays every morning with a tripod and a camera, looking at the distanceThanks a lot to all those great photographers who gave this week to me, when so many of them were equally deserving.aldo', '2002-09-30 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130887, 6291, 1202, '<td valign="top">Yours is a dreat picture.   You have proven that patience and a good eye can capture a vision in only a few shots.   I am glad to see that you were able to take a picture and not make one in the post processing.<br/>Keep up the good work!<br/>Autool</td>', 'Yours is a dreat picture.   You have proven that patience and a good eye can capture a vision in only a few shots.   I am glad to see that you were able to take a picture and not make one in the post processing.Keep up the good work!Autool', '2002-10-01 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130888, 6291, 51, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to let you know that this is one of the finest pictures I have seen here or anywhere. The shadows on the mountain, the clouds, the colors, the framing, everything is perfect. I''m jealous and if I ever find out who the two people are who gave it a "1" I''ll request their voting priveleges be taken away.</td>', 'I just wanted to let you know that this is one of the finest pictures I have seen here or anywhere. The shadows on the mountain, the clouds, the colors, the framing, everything is perfect. I''m jealous and if I ever find out who the two people are who gave it a "1" I''ll request their voting priveleges be taken away.', '2002-10-03 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130889, 6291, 2317, '<td valign="top">Aldo:<br/><br/>Felicidades, realmente una foto hermosa; eres un estuche de monerías.<br/><br/>Saludos <br/><br/>Emma Rosas</td>', 'Aldo:Felicidades, realmente una foto hermosa; eres un estuche de monerías.Saludos Emma Rosas', '2002-10-03 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
