(130967, 6298, 82, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the input, as always.  :)  I see this time around that I wasn''t adept at providing a focal point or "subject" for my shot.  Still, I like my framing and do appreciate the variety of textures -- though admittedly, the "wow factor," if there is one, is not pronounced; I had intended to showcase an abstract expression of shape and tone.  We''ll miss this old house, I think, but we''re very happy with the new one.</td>', 'Thanks for the input, as always.  :)  I see this time around that I wasn''t adept at providing a focal point or "subject" for my shot.  Still, I like my framing and do appreciate the variety of textures -- though admittedly, the "wow factor," if there is one, is not pronounced; I had intended to showcase an abstract expression of shape and tone.  We''ll miss this old house, I think, but we''re very happy with the new one.', '2002-09-30 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
