(4478574, 6145, 3178, '<td valign="top">Pottymouth is incorrect. This photo is not photoshopped (except for color adjustment, which was allowed by the rules under which this photo was submitted). My picture is taken from a perspective about 150 degrees different than hers. I''m on a hill looking down across the city to the south. She is looking to the N - NE from sea level.</td>', 'Pottymouth is incorrect. This photo is not photoshopped (except for color adjustment, which was allowed by the rules under which this photo was submitted). My picture is taken from a perspective about 150 degrees different than hers. I''m on a hill looking down across the city to the south. She is looking to the N - NE from sea level.', '2008-02-11 17:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
