(126977, 5997, 3002, '<td valign="top">Points off for not being able to see the groom''s face.  Also, what is the point of focus here?  It is not ''clear'', and neither the couple OR that barn in the background is in focus.  I would have cropped this shot with the couple standing to the right of the barn, with the lawn to the left of them (facing the photo).</td>', 'Points off for not being able to see the groom''s face.  Also, what is the point of focus here?  It is not ''clear'', and neither the couple OR that barn in the background is in focus.  I would have cropped this shot with the couple standing to the right of the barn, with the lawn to the left of them (facing the photo).', '2002-09-23 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
