(126987, 5997, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful wedding photo that I''m sure the couple will cherish. It''s a great take on "your corner of the world". The composition of it is simple, yet compelling - the couple on one third, the farmhouse in the distance on the other. There''s a sense of both a history and a future for these two together (if that is their home). Very nice work.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful wedding photo that I''m sure the couple will cherish. It''s a great take on "your corner of the world". The composition of it is simple, yet compelling - the couple on one third, the farmhouse in the distance on the other. There''s a sense of both a history and a future for these two together (if that is their home). Very nice work.', '2002-09-28 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
