(126999, 6000, 1005, '<td valign="top">Just a bit soft on the focus.  The dead flower in the foreground, well...there''s just enough to "see", but I prefer foreward items like this a tad more prominent, sort of to say, "it''s there on purpose", rather than a bad accident that couldn''t be removed.  (follow me?)  7 Swash</td>', 'Just a bit soft on the focus.  The dead flower in the foreground, well...there''s just enough to "see", but I prefer foreward items like this a tad more prominent, sort of to say, "it''s there on purpose", rather than a bad accident that couldn''t be removed.  (follow me?)  7 Swash', '2002-09-25 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
