(127006, 6000, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if there is any particular reason why this isn''t really sharp that is no fault of yours, but for me, if I woulda took this shot, saw it fuzzy like this, I would be awful mad.  But it may be a compression problem, not the shot.</td>', 'I don''t know if there is any particular reason why this isn''t really sharp that is no fault of yours, but for me, if I woulda took this shot, saw it fuzzy like this, I would be awful mad.  But it may be a compression problem, not the shot.', '2002-09-27 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
