(127097, 6012, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=Nice idea<br/>Composition=nice diagonals from the street<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=good detail<br/>Exposure=well done.. just wonder if a slower shutter speed causing blur to show motion in the people and vehicles would add more interest.<br/>Interesting or Emotive=interesting angle and shows a perspective of your lifestyle<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=Nice ideaComposition=nice diagonals from the streetClarity (focus, details)=good detailExposure=well done.. just wonder if a slower shutter speed causing blur to show motion in the people and vehicles would add more interest.Interesting or Emotive=interesting angle and shows a perspective of your lifestyleI am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-26 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127098, 6012, 3138, '<td valign="top">I like this one because it reminds me of a camera angle you see from time to time in a Martin Scorcese (sp?) movie. And I like that because it''s a different way of looking at the world than our usual standing up horizontal view point. So well done on this one.  CJ</td>', 'I like this one because it reminds me of a camera angle you see from time to time in a Martin Scorcese (sp?) movie. And I like that because it''s a different way of looking at the world than our usual standing up horizontal view point. So well done on this one.  CJ', '2002-09-28 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
