(127185, 6016, 2997, '<td valign="top">Once again a b/w actually impresses me.  Including the element of the churning water was an excellent decision.  You had a few different "planes" that fought against you here--the rail, the shoreline and the skyline.  A slightly different angle may have helped.  But overall, an excellent picture.</td>', 'Once again a b/w actually impresses me.  Including the element of the churning water was an excellent decision.  You had a few different "planes" that fought against you here--the rail, the shoreline and the skyline.  A slightly different angle may have helped.  But overall, an excellent picture.', '2002-09-23 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127186, 6016, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  Meets the challenge.  I think I would have liked this one more in color.  The b&amp;w seems to lose a lot of detail on this one.  Focus looks good, lighting is a bit dark on the shore.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Nice picture.  Meets the challenge.  I think I would have liked this one more in color.  The b&w seems to lose a lot of detail on this one.  Focus looks good, lighting is a bit dark on the shore.  6 waltoml.', '2002-09-25 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127187, 6016, 4173, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the railing in this shot.  Without it the picture would lose a sense of character.  Not a strong photo, but the b &amp; w helps.  Good work. 6</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the railing in this shot.  Without it the picture would lose a sense of character.  Not a strong photo, but the b & w helps.  Good work. 6', '2002-09-25 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
