(127193, 6017, 3936, '<td valign="top">The bad part of CCD''s is the vertical stripes they leave when you have very bright points of light.  The candles probably looked great in person, but distract from the room.  My eyes always wind up over at that edge of the picture.</td>', 'The bad part of CCD''s is the vertical stripes they leave when you have very bright points of light.  The candles probably looked great in person, but distract from the room.  My eyes always wind up over at that edge of the picture.', '2002-09-24 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
