(127256, 6019, 1280, '<td valign="top">The subject is pretty well exposed  but the composition is not one of your best.  It really bugs me that there is something red in the urinal and I can''t see what it is.  On top of the urinal lies your forbidden fruit again...I''m so glad it''s fake since food in the bathroom is a general turn off to me.    <br/>Technically the image is fine but I don''t find it appealing.   On the other hand I sense your sarcasm so that makes the image effective. Giving you a 7. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'The subject is pretty well exposed  but the composition is not one of your best.  It really bugs me that there is something red in the urinal and I can''t see what it is.  On top of the urinal lies your forbidden fruit again...I''m so glad it''s fake since food in the bathroom is a general turn off to me.    Technically the image is fine but I don''t find it appealing.   On the other hand I sense your sarcasm so that makes the image effective. Giving you a 7. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-25 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
