(127279, 6019, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I''m so glad you used my suggestion for a title!  :)  As usual, a very interesting shot.  I''d say that I hope you didn''t eat the apple, but in addition to it being stuck on a urinal, I recall you said it was plastic anyway!<br/><br/>Anyway, I like what you did with the saturation levels here.  Bringing out the apple (and the little thingy you pee on) is very effective here.  The detail is very crisp, and I like the slight reflection at the bottom quarter of the urinal.  (Those are definitely some words I wouldn''t have anticipated typing today.)</td>', 'Hey!  I''m so glad you used my suggestion for a title!  :)  As usual, a very interesting shot.  I''d say that I hope you didn''t eat the apple, but in addition to it being stuck on a urinal, I recall you said it was plastic anyway!Anyway, I like what you did with the saturation levels here.  Bringing out the apple (and the little thingy you pee on) is very effective here.  The detail is very crisp, and I like the slight reflection at the bottom quarter of the urinal.  (Those are definitely some words I wouldn''t have anticipated typing today.)', '2002-09-28 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
