(127310, 6021, 2798, '<td valign="top">This is very tricky exposure situation and I dont think your camera has helped you out much. The light at the bottom is over exposed and the top of the tower, where your eye should come to rest, is too dark. The colours are attractive, though and I''ve no doubt it''s from your corner of the world. 6 - floyd</td>', 'This is very tricky exposure situation and I dont think your camera has helped you out much. The light at the bottom is over exposed and the top of the tower, where your eye should come to rest, is too dark. The colours are attractive, though and I''ve no doubt it''s from your corner of the world. 6 - floyd', '2002-09-24 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
