(127314, 6021, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has very good potential.  The lighting here may need a little assistance... this image goes from blown out at the bottom to too dark at the top of the tower, IMO.  It appears that, unfortunately, the natural lighting on this tower is not very even.  I seriously doubt that there is a really great way to photograph this at night without  some extra lighting of some sort... subjectively, I like it :) - setzler</td>', 'I think this photo has very good potential.  The lighting here may need a little assistance... this image goes from blown out at the bottom to too dark at the top of the tower, IMO.  It appears that, unfortunately, the natural lighting on this tower is not very even.  I seriously doubt that there is a really great way to photograph this at night without  some extra lighting of some sort... subjectively, I like it :) - setzler', '2002-09-27 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
