(127330, 6022, 3818, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out if this is a real person in the photo...or a sculpture of a person! Either way, it''s a cool shot. A bit cropped off the top might keep the moon more *in* the picture. All that basically empty space at the top causes our eyes to get a bit *lost*, because the moon is at the opposite side of the photo. Keeping the top of pic on the low side would get our eyes to bounce back and forth between the two subjects a little more evenly. Good effort...almost perfect!</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out if this is a real person in the photo...or a sculpture of a person! Either way, it''s a cool shot. A bit cropped off the top might keep the moon more *in* the picture. All that basically empty space at the top causes our eyes to get a bit *lost*, because the moon is at the opposite side of the photo. Keeping the top of pic on the low side would get our eyes to bounce back and forth between the two subjects a little more evenly. Good effort...almost perfect!', '2002-09-24 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
