(127399, 6025, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of the places I''d love to visit someday!  Overall, it''s a cool shot... my suggestions would be to pan a little higher to eliminate the ledge, and to try not to split the shot in the center so much where the sky meets the city...</td>', 'One of the places I''d love to visit someday!  Overall, it''s a cool shot... my suggestions would be to pan a little higher to eliminate the ledge, and to try not to split the shot in the center so much where the sky meets the city...', '2002-09-23 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
