(127401, 6025, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  It seems to me it would benefit if the horizon line wasn''t so dead center though. Perhaps just a but higher would make the building on the left seem taller.</td>', 'Neat shot.  It seems to me it would benefit if the horizon line wasn''t so dead center though. Perhaps just a but higher would make the building on the left seem taller.', '2002-09-23 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127402, 6025, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good skyline picture and certainly meets the challenge.  I think it would have more punch to it if had more contrast and the color more saturated.  Or to completely remove the color and do a b &amp; w with more contrast.  The colors are too drab to really add virtue to the image imo and that''s why I have made these suggestions.  However, you MUST shoot to please yourself.   I hope these comments help and not hurt.  :-) Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Good skyline picture and certainly meets the challenge.  I think it would have more punch to it if had more contrast and the color more saturated.  Or to completely remove the color and do a b & w with more contrast.  The colors are too drab to really add virtue to the image imo and that''s why I have made these suggestions.  However, you MUST shoot to please yourself.   I hope these comments help and not hurt.  :-) Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-23 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
