(127411, 6025, 843, '<td valign="top">Only thing I would have done differently is crop the grey from the bottom</td>', 'Only thing I would have done differently is crop the grey from the bottom', '2002-09-25 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127412, 6025, 2044, '<td valign="top">too dark around the buildings</td>', 'too dark around the buildings', '2002-09-26 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127413, 6025, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice cityscape... I like the composition of the tallest building on the left... the strip of ? across the bottom of the frame is a bit of a distraction from the overall image.. maybe that could have been cropped out?  The horizon is nice and level as well... good attention on that :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a nice cityscape... I like the composition of the tallest building on the left... the strip of ? across the bottom of the frame is a bit of a distraction from the overall image.. maybe that could have been cropped out?  The horizon is nice and level as well... good attention on that :) - setzler', '2002-09-26 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127414, 6025, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape shot.  I like how the horizon is cut perfectly into the tall building at just the right elevation.  I thinK i know where someone might be going for the next challenge!!  Good job.</td>', 'Nice cityscape shot.  I like how the horizon is cut perfectly into the tall building at just the right elevation.  I thinK i know where someone might be going for the next challenge!!  Good job.', '2002-09-27 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127415, 6025, 1037, '<td valign="top">That can''t be Melbourne! There''s not a cloud in the sky! Haven''t you seen "He Died with a Falafel in his Hand"? You must have photoshopped all the rain out :P.<br/><br/>Hehe, it''s a great cityscape shot. I think if you could have cropped out that sill or whatever it is at the bottom of the photo I would have given it 10, but it''ll have to stay at 9. lisae</td>', 'That can''t be Melbourne! There''s not a cloud in the sky! Haven''t you seen "He Died with a Falafel in his Hand"? You must have photoshopped all the rain out :P.Hehe, it''s a great cityscape shot. I think if you could have cropped out that sill or whatever it is at the bottom of the photo I would have given it 10, but it''ll have to stay at 9. lisae', '2002-09-28 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127416, 6027, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- cool colors!!  This looks like a scene out of Ghostbusters.  I like this a LOT -9</td>', 'Wow -- cool colors!!  This looks like a scene out of Ghostbusters.  I like this a LOT -9', '2002-09-23 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
