(127796, 6060, 3859, '<td valign="top">A bit pink.  And a bit strange!  Very strange, indeed.  But I must admit, I''ve never seen anything like it before. Not a great photo, IMO, but a funny idea!<br/>P.S.  <br/> I think red rooster lost a leg.</td>', 'A bit pink.  And a bit strange!  Very strange, indeed.  But I must admit, I''ve never seen anything like it before. Not a great photo, IMO, but a funny idea!P.S.   I think red rooster lost a leg.', '2002-09-25 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127797, 6060, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the pink tint, although I''m guessing that''s the color of the wall.  I may have considered moving the roosters to a better location for this one, perhaps.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the pink tint, although I''m guessing that''s the color of the wall.  I may have considered moving the roosters to a better location for this one, perhaps.', '2002-09-29 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
