(127809, 6062, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the textures. I like the ''stillness'' feeling as well. I think there is too much empty wall space on the right.</td>', 'I like the colors and the textures. I like the ''stillness'' feeling as well. I think there is too much empty wall space on the right.', '2002-09-25 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
