(127813, 6062, 3178, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the light through the colored glass on the wall. The towel looks sort of lonely, sets an interesting mood. 7 - chrisab.</td>', 'Nice effect with the light through the colored glass on the wall. The towel looks sort of lonely, sets an interesting mood. 7 - chrisab.', '2002-09-28 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
