(127815, 6062, 671, '<td valign="top">the simplicity of this, and subtle colors make this very appealing.</td>', 'the simplicity of this, and subtle colors make this very appealing.', '2002-09-29 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127816, 6062, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition... I love the yellow glow... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice composition... I love the yellow glow... good work :) - setzler', '2002-09-29 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127817, 6062, 2764, '<td valign="top">This should have done better It was my third favorite.</td>', 'This should have done better It was my third favorite.', '2002-09-30 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(127818, 6063, 4049, '<td valign="top">Needs stronger composition, maybe if it had been taken portrait, instead of landscapped to see more of the building behind. Just leaves me wanting to see more of the surroundings...</td>', 'Needs stronger composition, maybe if it had been taken portrait, instead of landscapped to see more of the building behind. Just leaves me wanting to see more of the surroundings...', '2002-09-23 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127819, 6063, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking spot. Good luck. Justine</td>', 'Very cool looking spot. Good luck. Justine', '2002-09-23 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127820, 6063, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-24 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127821, 6063, 2244, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.  Did you try vertical with just the tables &amp; umbellas + church as backdrop?  Could also be interesting. 6 chakkobbo</td>', 'Like the idea.  Did you try vertical with just the tables & umbellas + church as backdrop?  Could also be interesting. 6 chakkobbo', '2002-09-24 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127822, 6063, 3672, '<td valign="top">I think I''m turning into a BW fan! good job 8 smshats</td>', 'I think I''m turning into a BW fan! good job 8 smshats', '2002-09-24 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127823, 6063, 2700, '<td valign="top">I dont think B&amp;W works well.. It would be more interesting to see the old building contrasted with the new chairs/building in color...</td>', 'I dont think B&W works well.. It would be more interesting to see the old building contrasted with the new chairs/building in color...', '2002-09-24 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127824, 6063, 2923, '<td valign="top">Is that tree on the left really necessary to be in this composition?  I find the building interesting, especially the one with the two openings.  I also think that a vertical compositio nworks better -- move 3-4 steps to the right, making the building a bit symmetrical, go vertical on your camera, move a bit closer so that the seats, table, shade be a main interesting and let the contrast between the white umbrella and the nice texture of the building do the talking.  The tree and the open space on the left is just too distracting, for me.  6 paganini</td>', 'Is that tree on the left really necessary to be in this composition?  I find the building interesting, especially the one with the two openings.  I also think that a vertical compositio nworks better -- move 3-4 steps to the right, making the building a bit symmetrical, go vertical on your camera, move a bit closer so that the seats, table, shade be a main interesting and let the contrast between the white umbrella and the nice texture of the building do the talking.  The tree and the open space on the left is just too distracting, for me.  6 paganini', '2002-09-25 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127825, 6063, 4005, '<td valign="top">goood... the black ''n white makes it even better in my eyes!</td>', 'goood... the black ''n white makes it even better in my eyes!', '2002-09-25 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127826, 6063, 3112, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed. At least, darken and boost contrast. A bit cluttered in the foreground.</td>', 'A little overexposed. At least, darken and boost contrast. A bit cluttered in the foreground.', '2002-09-25 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127827, 6063, 3447, '<td valign="top">Served by the padre?  Interesting.                     JEM</td>', 'Served by the padre?  Interesting.                     JEM', '2002-09-25 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127828, 6063, 2857, '<td valign="top">yes, but do they have donuts? ;-)<br/><br/>nice shot.</td>', 'yes, but do they have donuts? ;-)nice shot.', '2002-09-26 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127829, 6063, 3095, '<td valign="top">I only wish... doesn''t matter how the coffee tastes!</td>', 'I only wish... doesn''t matter how the coffee tastes!', '2002-09-26 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127830, 6063, 2323, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a coffee place!  The black and white doesn''t really work for me here-- probably because it masks a lot of the detail to be found in the beautiful old buiilding.    --5-- sohr</td>', 'That''s quite a coffee place!  The black and white doesn''t really work for me here-- probably because it masks a lot of the detail to be found in the beautiful old buiilding.    --5-- sohr', '2002-09-28 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127831, 6063, 3102, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool!  I may have been tempted to leave out the other building and the motorcycle, while focusing in more on the tables/main building.  Perhaps standing a few steps to the left could have accomplished that...?</td>', 'Pretty cool!  I may have been tempted to leave out the other building and the motorcycle, while focusing in more on the tables/main building.  Perhaps standing a few steps to the left could have accomplished that...?', '2002-09-28 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127832, 6064, 92, '<td valign="top">The man and object need to be in or out of the photo. It''s distracting:( I think it would rate much higher if you just fixed that</td>', 'The man and object need to be in or out of the photo. It''s distracting:( I think it would rate much higher if you just fixed that', '2002-09-23 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127833, 6064, 1255, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but I wish wish the person on the right was either included more or not at all.</td>', 'Great photo, but I wish wish the person on the right was either included more or not at all.', '2002-09-23 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127834, 6064, 2279, '<td valign="top">Ive been there before.. I feel for you. Nice shot. What ship is this? -byetko</td>', 'Ive been there before.. I feel for you. Nice shot. What ship is this? -byetko', '2002-09-23 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127835, 6064, 1280, '<td valign="top">The light on the sea is very nice.  I''d like to have seen either more of the person, or not at all.  The very little showing makes me feel something is cut off.   What is the object on the left?   Perhaps if more of that were included it would enhance the theme. Your horizon is nice and even. So often people unitentionally tilt it.  Like ME!!!  Good job! Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'The light on the sea is very nice.  I''d like to have seen either more of the person, or not at all.  The very little showing makes me feel something is cut off.   What is the object on the left?   Perhaps if more of that were included it would enhance the theme. Your horizon is nice and even. So often people unitentionally tilt it.  Like ME!!!  Good job! Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-23 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127836, 6064, 327, '<td valign="top">For me personally I''d of liked more of the guy to the right. Either more or none at all. I don''t think he adds much here and is distracting. Over all I love the shot, the b&amp;w is very good as is the reflecting water. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'For me personally I''d of liked more of the guy to the right. Either more or none at all. I don''t think he adds much here and is distracting. Over all I love the shot, the b&w is very good as is the reflecting water. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-23 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127837, 6064, 2130, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to c a little more (or nothing at all) of the face</td>', 'I would have liked to c a little more (or nothing at all) of the face', '2002-09-23 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127838, 6064, 3859, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  However, I would like to see a bit more of the profile on the right.  The way it is looks a bit odd.  I see a profile and no neck.  Sort of like a head floating into the picture. Black and white works well.</td>', 'Nice idea.  However, I would like to see a bit more of the profile on the right.  The way it is looks a bit odd.  I see a profile and no neck.  Sort of like a head floating into the picture. Black and white works well.', '2002-09-24 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127839, 6064, 3447, '<td valign="top">Perhaps more of the body on right.  Interesting.                     JEM</td>', 'Perhaps more of the body on right.  Interesting.                     JEM', '2002-09-24 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127840, 6064, 1005, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get your title....does it have something to do with the man that is almost cropped out of the photo?  (also a problem to me)  6 Swash</td>', 'I don''t really get your title....does it have something to do with the man that is almost cropped out of the photo?  (also a problem to me)  6 Swash', '2002-09-25 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127841, 6064, 51, '<td valign="top">not framed properly, but had potential. good start.</td>', 'not framed properly, but had potential. good start.', '2002-09-26 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127842, 6064, 3902, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a little bit more of the man''s face - maybe about half his head. Great Shot.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a little bit more of the man''s face - maybe about half his head. Great Shot.', '2002-09-26 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127843, 6064, 806, '<td valign="top">I think the figure on the right should be included more, or eliminated. While framing the shot, the object on the left could be seen less than the figure.</td>', 'I think the figure on the right should be included more, or eliminated. While framing the shot, the object on the left could be seen less than the figure.', '2002-09-26 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127844, 6064, 3965, '<td valign="top">I like it, but would like to see a TEENY bit more of the person''s face.</td>', 'I like it, but would like to see a TEENY bit more of the person''s face.', '2002-09-26 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127845, 6064, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot :)  I like the sun glare on the water quite a bit... compositionally, I think you should have included more of the person on the right side of the frame... having the face sliced as it is here seems a bit odd... good shot :) = 7 - setzler</td>', 'interesting shot :)  I like the sun glare on the water quite a bit... compositionally, I think you should have included more of the person on the right side of the frame... having the face sliced as it is here seems a bit odd... good shot :) = 7 - setzler', '2002-09-27 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127846, 6064, 3102, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen either more or less of the guy on the right.  It seems a little distracting to have only half of him there.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen either more or less of the guy on the right.  It seems a little distracting to have only half of him there.', '2002-09-28 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127847, 6064, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-29 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127848, 6064, 1135, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the man on the right, very intriguing photo. rcrawford</td>', 'I would like to see more of the man on the right, very intriguing photo. rcrawford', '2002-09-29 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127849, 6065, 327, '<td valign="top">&amp;lt;lol&amp;gt; The tounge. Fun shot. Score 6 Justine</td>', '&lt;lol&gt; The tounge. Fun shot. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-23 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127850, 6065, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good focusing, because it really makes the object stand out, as do the colour contrasts. I''m quite distracted by what looks like a scientific test-tube on the left of the statue though, and composition wise, I think the statue should be more to the left (see JMSetzler''s "Rule of Thirds" guide in the tutorial section)<br/>5<br/>Konador</td>', 'Good focusing, because it really makes the object stand out, as do the colour contrasts. I''m quite distracted by what looks like a scientific test-tube on the left of the statue though, and composition wise, I think the statue should be more to the left (see JMSetzler''s "Rule of Thirds" guide in the tutorial section)5Konador', '2002-09-23 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127851, 6065, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is really kind of funny......kind of.  Not the picture itself, but the creature with his tongue out.  As if he is saying "Nanny Nanny Boo Boo...."</td>', 'This is really kind of funny......kind of.  Not the picture itself, but the creature with his tongue out.  As if he is saying "Nanny Nanny Boo Boo...."', '2002-09-24 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127852, 6065, 3447, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a bit sharper.  Would like to see top of statue.      JEM</td>', 'Focus could be a bit sharper.  Would like to see top of statue.      JEM', '2002-09-24 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127853, 6065, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast: 5Good composition.  6<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood 6      Impact to the viewer 5<br/>Relevance to the Challenge 6<br/>overall6<br/>sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast: 5Good composition.  6Tells a story or creates a mood 6      Impact to the viewer 5Relevance to the Challenge 6overall6sulamk', '2002-09-25 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127854, 6065, 772, '<td valign="top">I understand the capture of ''your corner of the world'' in this photo, but on the subjectivity scale, there is nothing that really grabs me and says HELLO.  This statue doesn''t really relate me to anything.  I can''t tell anything about ''your'' corner of the world unless it is collecting statues or gardening maybe?  - setzler</td>', 'I understand the capture of ''your corner of the world'' in this photo, but on the subjectivity scale, there is nothing that really grabs me and says HELLO.  This statue doesn''t really relate me to anything.  I can''t tell anything about ''your'' corner of the world unless it is collecting statues or gardening maybe?  - setzler', '2002-09-25 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127855, 6065, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  What kind of mint (kinda looks like peppermint)?  Looks like the gargoyle could use a coat (of paint).  The grass in the foreground is a nice touch, but I would have liked a little more of it.  Is that a rain guage behind the gargoyle?  There''s something about the lower right corner that bugs me, it''s "extra" soft.  Score upgrade, started as a 7, but I am appreciating this more than that.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo.  What kind of mint (kinda looks like peppermint)?  Looks like the gargoyle could use a coat (of paint).  The grass in the foreground is a nice touch, but I would have liked a little more of it.  Is that a rain guage behind the gargoyle?  There''s something about the lower right corner that bugs me, it''s "extra" soft.  Score upgrade, started as a 7, but I am appreciating this more than that.  8 Swash', '2002-09-25 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127856, 6065, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-26 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(127857, 6065, 2472, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, this image is not sharp at all, and the subject, with a dull light, is not atrative in any sense. The lack of a primary source of light makes it look flat, with no contrast and  definition. The contrast resulting from this white paint against the greenery is not aesthetic, so the composition is feeble; placing the subject in the center, and cropping it''s upper edge is part of the problem.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, this image is not sharp at all, and the subject, with a dull light, is not atrative in any sense. The lack of a primary source of light makes it look flat, with no contrast and  definition. The contrast resulting from this white paint against the greenery is not aesthetic, so the composition is feeble; placing the subject in the center, and cropping it''s upper edge is part of the problem.', '2002-09-26 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
