(127951, 6073, 2997, '<td valign="top">I commend you on capturing both the spirit of the challenge (something about where you live) and a truly artistic photograph.  Since I find only "good" in this picture it is difficult to suggest any improvements.   Perhaps a 1-degree tilt to the right might be helpful.</td>', 'I commend you on capturing both the spirit of the challenge (something about where you live) and a truly artistic photograph.  Since I find only "good" in this picture it is difficult to suggest any improvements.   Perhaps a 1-degree tilt to the right might be helpful.', '2002-09-28 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
