(127993, 6077, 2323, '<td valign="top">Good job of framing here.  It appears the picture is leaning (notice the distance between the left hand edge of the photo and the flagpole), which is a bit distracting.  Also, shooting from underneath sunlight into shadow will confuse most cameras--  the front of the building is underexposed.  --5-- sohr</td>', 'Good job of framing here.  It appears the picture is leaning (notice the distance between the left hand edge of the photo and the flagpole), which is a bit distracting.  Also, shooting from underneath sunlight into shadow will confuse most cameras--  the front of the building is underexposed.  --5-- sohr', '2002-09-28 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
