(128264, 6112, 2997, '<td valign="top">From the appearance of both the statue and the curb line, it gives the impression that the horizon is a bit off.  If you had cropped this at the base of Washington''s foot to the top of the current frame, you would have lost the lower portion of the building, but possibly driven home a stronger message.  (I don''t know for sure, it is just my subjective opinion.)</td>', 'From the appearance of both the statue and the curb line, it gives the impression that the horizon is a bit off.  If you had cropped this at the base of Washington''s foot to the top of the current frame, you would have lost the lower portion of the building, but possibly driven home a stronger message.  (I don''t know for sure, it is just my subjective opinion.)', '2002-09-23 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
