(128276, 6112, 2923, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/><br/>A bit about the tilt:  it''s due to the lens wideangle.  Either both of the statue and the building will be curved and pointing at each other, or i can set one or the other to be straight.  Now if i have a PC lens, then that''s one thing :-)<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments.A bit about the tilt:  it''s due to the lens wideangle.  Either both of the statue and the building will be curved and pointing at each other, or i can set one or the other to be straight.  Now if i have a PC lens, then that''s one thing :-)', '2002-09-30 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
