(128302, 6114, 327, '<td valign="top">Hi all. I''m so proud most of you liked my shot.<br/>I''ll agree with the _rest_ of you that this isn''t the state capital, or a famous bridge that screams where I live. It is abstract.<br/>This is however a fir tree. In Oregon we live and breath fir, pine, evergreen-wood. That and it rains buckets. We are famous for our trees and our rain. My yard reflects that and this shot was taken in my front yard.<br/>I would do it differently if I did it again. This was a learning lesson and I thank you all again.<br/></td>', 'Hi all. I''m so proud most of you liked my shot.I''ll agree with the _rest_ of you that this isn''t the state capital, or a famous bridge that screams where I live. It is abstract.This is however a fir tree. In Oregon we live and breath fir, pine, evergreen-wood. That and it rains buckets. We are famous for our trees and our rain. My yard reflects that and this shot was taken in my front yard.I would do it differently if I did it again. This was a learning lesson and I thank you all again.', '2002-09-30 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
