(128368, 6119, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photo. It almost seems like something from a scanning electron microscope. I don''t know about meeting the challenge though... it seems like you''re relying on the title. I''d only deduct one point for that if anything though, I''m not a challenge nazi.</td>', 'This is a really cool photo. It almost seems like something from a scanning electron microscope. I don''t know about meeting the challenge though... it seems like you''re relying on the title. I''d only deduct one point for that if anything though, I''m not a challenge nazi.', '2002-09-28 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
