(128371, 6119, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, this looks like a pretty scary plant!  I''m not sure it says a lot about "your corner of the world," but it''s an interesting shot...</td>', 'Well, this looks like a pretty scary plant!  I''m not sure it says a lot about "your corner of the world," but it''s an interesting shot...', '2002-09-28 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128372, 6119, 573, '<td valign="top">Therefore you are a plant.</td>', 'Therefore you are a plant.', '2002-09-29 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128373, 6120, 1877, '<td valign="top">I love the lines and shapes in this photo. The only thing that bothers me is the sky, but i''m assuming it was a somewhat overcast-ish day and those are hard to deal with. Still, the colors pop out, which is great. 8 (the sky thing holds me back from anything higher, sorry!!)</td>', 'I love the lines and shapes in this photo. The only thing that bothers me is the sky, but i''m assuming it was a somewhat overcast-ish day and those are hard to deal with. Still, the colors pop out, which is great. 8 (the sky thing holds me back from anything higher, sorry!!)', '2002-09-23 04:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128374, 6120, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very cool! i love these buildings all squished together. It''s interesting - esp to someone from America where we don''t have bldgs like this. I think I like them in color too. Definitely a good, sharp pic even if I think I''d like to see below the bottom edge of the picture. GOOD WORK!  ~indi</td>', 'Very cool! i love these buildings all squished together. It''s interesting - esp to someone from America where we don''t have bldgs like this. I think I like them in color too. Definitely a good, sharp pic even if I think I''d like to see below the bottom edge of the picture. GOOD WORK!  ~indi', '2002-09-23 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128375, 6120, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice, good color and lighting.</td>', 'Really nice, good color and lighting.', '2002-09-23 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128376, 6120, 92, '<td valign="top">I''m so drawn in by this photo. The colors and textures give it a wonderful effect. I would love to see this in a oil painting. It''s just got that homey look that really meets the challenge this week. = 9 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I''m so drawn in by this photo. The colors and textures give it a wonderful effect. I would love to see this in a oil painting. It''s just got that homey look that really meets the challenge this week. = 9 Shiiizzzam', '2002-09-23 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128377, 6120, 327, '<td valign="top">Just great texture, color and composition..very nice shot. Good luck. Justine score 8</td>', 'Just great texture, color and composition..very nice shot. Good luck. Justine score 8', '2002-09-23 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128378, 6120, 3112, '<td valign="top">I would like this better with more cropping to remove the blown out sky.  6</td>', 'I would like this better with more cropping to remove the blown out sky.  6', '2002-09-23 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128379, 6120, 2158, '<td valign="top">Wish I lived somewhere as attractive as that.</td>', 'Wish I lived somewhere as attractive as that.', '2002-09-23 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128380, 6120, 3102, '<td valign="top">Me likes!  This is a very nice collection of buildings with very visually appealing characteristics!  Well done.</td>', 'Me likes!  This is a very nice collection of buildings with very visually appealing characteristics!  Well done.', '2002-09-23 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128381, 6120, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; love the angles and the colors.  I like how the composition draws the eye right up to the roofline and the lovely ornate architecture up there.  What an interesting looking place! lhall-8</td>', 'Nice shot; love the angles and the colors.  I like how the composition draws the eye right up to the roofline and the lovely ornate architecture up there.  What an interesting looking place! lhall-8', '2002-09-24 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128382, 6120, 2764, '<td valign="top">Definately the most beautiful shot of the lot this week!  My favorite anyways.  Composition is perfect, colors are wonderful. 10</td>', 'Definately the most beautiful shot of the lot this week!  My favorite anyways.  Composition is perfect, colors are wonderful. 10', '2002-09-24 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128383, 6120, 3860, '<td valign="top">i wish to be there. Nice photo</td>', 'i wish to be there. Nice photo', '2002-09-25 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128384, 6120, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like about this shot that it is at once both very simple and yet very layered.  It definitely takes me into your world, which is incidentally very different from mine by all outward appearances.  The repetition and the variation in the rooflines is interesting to me.  8, just-married</td>', 'I like about this shot that it is at once both very simple and yet very layered.  It definitely takes me into your world, which is incidentally very different from mine by all outward appearances.  The repetition and the variation in the rooflines is interesting to me.  8, just-married', '2002-09-25 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128385, 6120, 3447, '<td valign="top">Great interplay of architectural lines.                    JEM</td>', 'Great interplay of architectural lines.                    JEM', '2002-09-25 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128386, 6120, 656, '<td valign="top">I recognise the English skies!  I think this would suit from a tigher crop, on the foreground buildings perhaps- yes it would look ''jumbled and cramped'' but that is the way the houses seem to be so it would be well reflected in the image.  I''d try to avoid the sky in shots when it is dull and grey like this.</td>', 'I recognise the English skies!  I think this would suit from a tigher crop, on the foreground buildings perhaps- yes it would look ''jumbled and cramped'' but that is the way the houses seem to be so it would be well reflected in the image.  I''d try to avoid the sky in shots when it is dull and grey like this.', '2002-09-26 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128387, 6120, 3936, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  Makes me want to go there.  Great angle, none of the falling over building trap that so many fall into.</td>', 'Nice pic.  Makes me want to go there.  Great angle, none of the falling over building trap that so many fall into.', '2002-09-26 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128388, 6120, 3095, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for the old Europe photos.</td>', 'I am a sucker for the old Europe photos.', '2002-09-26 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
