(128393, 6120, 2667, '<td valign="top">a lot of elements shown to perfection. i can feel the (by modern standards) cramped steets. i love the colors here, too. great composition impeccably balanced. (10)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'a lot of elements shown to perfection. i can feel the (by modern standards) cramped steets. i love the colors here, too. great composition impeccably balanced. (10)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-28 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
