(128395, 6120, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=It was a bright sunny day.. what happened to the sky?<br/>Composition=good<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=good<br/>Exposure=sky bothers me, but the other colors and details are excellent<br/>Interesting or Emotive=above avg.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=It was a bright sunny day.. what happened to the sky?Composition=goodClarity (focus, details)=goodExposure=sky bothers me, but the other colors and details are excellentInteresting or Emotive=above avg.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
