(128401, 6121, 1005, '<td valign="top">It could be the cement, but the shot seems a triffle soft.  I do see some details, for ex. what is going on inside the columns?  Does a bell reside in there?  The crop at the bottom is a little off, if there weren''t other considerations, I would have liked to see that circle disappear naturally.  7 Swash</td>', 'It could be the cement, but the shot seems a triffle soft.  I do see some details, for ex. what is going on inside the columns?  Does a bell reside in there?  The crop at the bottom is a little off, if there weren''t other considerations, I would have liked to see that circle disappear naturally.  7 Swash', '2002-09-25 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
