(128472, 6132, 436, '<td valign="top">battle creek is fun and so is a trip to cereal city!  I am glad not to live in Michigan any longer, tho.  You captured the entrance quite nicely and the foggy rain did a good job of obscuring an otherwise bland parking lost.  What if you cropped in even more or shot the line as the cereal boxes rolled down just inside the door?  Did you try catching Tony as he walked around/among the tourists?  Just other ideas that might have had more wow factor.  Nicely done.</td>', 'battle creek is fun and so is a trip to cereal city!  I am glad not to live in Michigan any longer, tho.  You captured the entrance quite nicely and the foggy rain did a good job of obscuring an otherwise bland parking lost.  What if you cropped in even more or shot the line as the cereal boxes rolled down just inside the door?  Did you try catching Tony as he walked around/among the tourists?  Just other ideas that might have had more wow factor.  Nicely done.', '2002-09-23 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128473, 6132, 327, '<td valign="top">&amp;lt;lol&amp;gt; Cereal City...WOW just a fun shot. If we didn''t have Kelloggs in my house we wouldn''t have dinner at least two nights a week! Good luck. Score 7 Justine</td>', '&lt;lol&gt; Cereal City...WOW just a fun shot. If we didn''t have Kelloggs in my house we wouldn''t have dinner at least two nights a week! Good luck. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-23 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
