(128476, 6132, 3102, '<td valign="top">I took that tour (I guess they don''t give the tour nowadays?) back in 1985, and I can remember smelling nothing but Corn Flakes for two solid days!  Anyway... this brings back some memories, but I''m not sure if this is the most compelling of shots.  I would have considered getting a much closer shot of the sign (eliminating the distracting cars/road, etc.)... or another symbol of the company that may have been more visually interesting.</td>', 'I took that tour (I guess they don''t give the tour nowadays?) back in 1985, and I can remember smelling nothing but Corn Flakes for two solid days!  Anyway... this brings back some memories, but I''m not sure if this is the most compelling of shots.  I would have considered getting a much closer shot of the sign (eliminating the distracting cars/road, etc.)... or another symbol of the company that may have been more visually interesting.', '2002-09-23 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
