(128560, 6138, 1041, '<td valign="top">i like reflections of lights on water, and yours are done well, but overall, my eyes are searching the dark a lot.  i think there''s just a little too much of it in the photo (for my liking).  i wonder what it would look like with the right side and top cropped so that the reflections really become the focus of the shot.<br/><br/>challenge met -- yes<br/>composition / appeal -- good.  maybe a little tighter crop.<br/>technical -- good.  reflections are well visible but lights are not blown out ... well balanced.<br/>overall -- 6<br/>gr8photos   :)</td>', 'i like reflections of lights on water, and yours are done well, but overall, my eyes are searching the dark a lot.  i think there''s just a little too much of it in the photo (for my liking).  i wonder what it would look like with the right side and top cropped so that the reflections really become the focus of the shot.challenge met -- yescomposition / appeal -- good.  maybe a little tighter crop.technical -- good.  reflections are well visible but lights are not blown out ... well balanced.overall -- 6gr8photos   :)', '2002-09-24 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
