(128569, 6138, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=interesting colors &amp; reflections<br/>Composition=the horizon being in the center of the shot cuts this photo into 2 images... upper and lower.  Better if offset higher or lower in the frame.<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=well done.<br/>Exposure=Maybe a bit underexposed even? not sure. Night shots are difficult. Overall well done.<br/>Interesting or Emotive=mildly interesting. Maybe the subject is too far away to be captivating.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=interesting colors & reflectionsComposition=the horizon being in the center of the shot cuts this photo into 2 images... upper and lower.  Better if offset higher or lower in the frame.Clarity (focus, details)=well done.Exposure=Maybe a bit underexposed even? not sure. Night shots are difficult. Overall well done.Interesting or Emotive=mildly interesting. Maybe the subject is too far away to be captivating.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-26 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
