(128590, 6139, 656, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m tilting all over the place - needs a flater horizon.  Wish I could see the top of the tree as well - reminds me of when I climbed this last year.</td>', 'I feel like I''m tilting all over the place - needs a flater horizon.  Wish I could see the top of the tree as well - reminds me of when I climbed this last year.', '2002-09-26 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128591, 6139, 637, '<td valign="top">Reasonably well ocmposed, although I''d like to see the top of the palm tree.  Nice colors.  I like the curved fence.  5 sjgleah</td>', 'Reasonably well ocmposed, although I''d like to see the top of the palm tree.  Nice colors.  I like the curved fence.  5 sjgleah', '2002-09-26 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128592, 6139, 3902, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. The colors are vibrant and the bridge pulls you right into the picture.</td>', 'Excellent composition. The colors are vibrant and the bridge pulls you right into the picture.', '2002-09-26 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128593, 6139, 1543, '<td valign="top">love the colors and detail.</td>', 'love the colors and detail.', '2002-09-26 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128594, 6139, 554, '<td valign="top">two things I would wish for here--treetop not cut off and a little sky visable above all the buildings that are under the bridge.  A 10 never the less.</td>', 'two things I would wish for here--treetop not cut off and a little sky visable above all the buildings that are under the bridge.  A 10 never the less.', '2002-09-28 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128595, 6139, 1037, '<td valign="top">God, I''ve been there so many times. I''m all nostalgic... I lived in Sydney for 4.5 years. This just needed some rotating in the clockwise direction to straighten up that horizon, or perhaps a little bit in the other direction to make it seem more jaunty, otherwise it''s just a bit awkward. Nicely framed otherwise.</td>', 'God, I''ve been there so many times. I''m all nostalgic... I lived in Sydney for 4.5 years. This just needed some rotating in the clockwise direction to straighten up that horizon, or perhaps a little bit in the other direction to make it seem more jaunty, otherwise it''s just a bit awkward. Nicely framed otherwise.', '2002-09-28 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128596, 6139, 2490, '<td valign="top">The focus on the bridge seems to be slightly off.  Might be haze, I can''t tell.  The grass and curving walk make it an 8 for me.  nards656</td>', 'The focus on the bridge seems to be slightly off.  Might be haze, I can''t tell.  The grass and curving walk make it an 8 for me.  nards656', '2002-09-29 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128597, 6139, 3704, '<td valign="top">You got one of my many 10''s this week perfect shot.</td>', 'You got one of my many 10''s this week perfect shot.', '2002-09-29 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128598, 6139, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=wow!<br/>Composition=well done! is it me, or does the land tilt down from right to left. I see how you made the bridge angle, but with that and the curve of the sidewalk and water, I think it is a bit slanted. Anyway.. love the curve of the sidewalk and water in relation to the linear bridge.<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=perfect!<br/>Exposure=perfect!<br/>Interesting or Emotive=lots for my eye to do in this image. Great!<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=wow!Composition=well done! is it me, or does the land tilt down from right to left. I see how you made the bridge angle, but with that and the curve of the sidewalk and water, I think it is a bit slanted. Anyway.. love the curve of the sidewalk and water in relation to the linear bridge.Clarity (focus, details)=perfect!Exposure=perfect!Interesting or Emotive=lots for my eye to do in this image. Great!I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128599, 6140, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape, indeed!</td>', 'Interesting landscape, indeed!', '2002-09-23 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128600, 6140, 51167, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view.  I love the outdoors.  I picked up a sport last year called Geocaching, that has brought me to many wonderful places like this.  Great shot. 9</td>', 'Beautiful view.  I love the outdoors.  I picked up a sport last year called Geocaching, that has brought me to many wonderful places like this.  Great shot. 9', '2002-09-23 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128601, 6140, 327, '<td valign="top">Breath taking. Beautiful color, view. Nicely done. Good luck Justine Score 8</td>', 'Breath taking. Beautiful color, view. Nicely done. Good luck Justine Score 8', '2002-09-23 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128602, 6140, 3280, '<td valign="top">Some view!! DPz</td>', 'Some view!! DPz', '2002-09-23 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128603, 6140, 3532, '<td valign="top">since the bushes are in the bottom of the frame, I think I would have liked to see them a little more in the frame.  Having them in the foreground would add to the sense of depth which seems to be the point of this picture. As it is, I find it a little distracting how the frame cuts across them.</td>', 'since the bushes are in the bottom of the frame, I think I would have liked to see them a little more in the frame.  Having them in the foreground would add to the sense of depth which seems to be the point of this picture. As it is, I find it a little distracting how the frame cuts across them.', '2002-09-24 04:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
