(128620, 6141, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite educated enough to understand the title... but I must say that your corner of the world encompasses quite a bit!  :)</td>', 'I''m not quite educated enough to understand the title... but I must say that your corner of the world encompasses quite a bit!  :)', '2002-09-23 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128621, 6141, 3936, '<td valign="top">Good moon shot, but does it really illustrate the topic?</td>', 'Good moon shot, but does it really illustrate the topic?', '2002-09-23 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128622, 6141, 2488, '<td valign="top">Nismo!!</td>', 'Nismo!!', '2002-09-24 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128623, 6141, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good shot of a full moon - perhaps would have liked to see a tiny bit more contrast. The main thing that is lacking, though is a link to "your corner of the world". It would have been nice to see how this image relates to you somehow - perhaps you''re a keen astronomer. That might have been shown by including a telescope. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Good shot of a full moon - perhaps would have liked to see a tiny bit more contrast. The main thing that is lacking, though is a link to "your corner of the world". It would have been nice to see how this image relates to you somehow - perhaps you''re a keen astronomer. That might have been shown by including a telescope. 7 - floyd', '2002-09-24 06:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128624, 6141, 1005, '<td valign="top">The moon has several problems that I see.  Around the whole edge is a "border" circle, most pronounced at the bottom.  Then there''s the odd, small dark blotches in the darker areas of the moon.  Plus the moon seems overall grainy.  Maybe a little less digital zoom would have helped.  6 Swash</td>', 'The moon has several problems that I see.  Around the whole edge is a "border" circle, most pronounced at the bottom.  Then there''s the odd, small dark blotches in the darker areas of the moon.  Plus the moon seems overall grainy.  Maybe a little less digital zoom would have helped.  6 Swash', '2002-09-25 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128625, 6141, 4175, '<td valign="top">DUH!!???!!!  You got some ''splainin'' to do !</td>', 'DUH!!???!!!  You got some ''splainin'' to do !', '2002-09-25 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128626, 6141, 2472, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, it could be the moon, or a ball of concrete. Too flat, dull light. I believe you chose a subject that is out of the reach of your camera''s capabilities.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, it could be the moon, or a ball of concrete. Too flat, dull light. I believe you chose a subject that is out of the reach of your camera''s capabilities.', '2002-09-26 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128627, 6141, 4057, '<td valign="top">Soooooo,your corner of the world is the.....moon??????</td>', 'Soooooo,your corner of the world is the.....moon??????', '2002-09-26 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128628, 6141, 3965, '<td valign="top">Does that mean "peace?"</td>', 'Does that mean "peace?"', '2002-09-26 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128629, 6141, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-27 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
