(128643, 6144, 2923, '<td valign="top">This must be Gordon, the other Austinite, i guess.  Congress bridge, at dawn, taken on Saturday (the only day in the week when the weather was clear) :-)  Should''ve taken one where the clouds were abound, would''ve been much more interesting as a photograph instead of a graduated change of color (and quite noisy too possibly due to sharpening).  In case you''re not Gordon, Bats in Austin are very popular. paganini</td>', 'This must be Gordon, the other Austinite, i guess.  Congress bridge, at dawn, taken on Saturday (the only day in the week when the weather was clear) :-)  Should''ve taken one where the clouds were abound, would''ve been much more interesting as a photograph instead of a graduated change of color (and quite noisy too possibly due to sharpening).  In case you''re not Gordon, Bats in Austin are very popular. paganini', '2002-09-23 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128644, 6144, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love your composition and color saturation.  I wonder about the title, will you explain it afterwards please?</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love your composition and color saturation.  I wonder about the title, will you explain it afterwards please?', '2002-09-23 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128645, 6144, 327, '<td valign="top">The colors here are perfect. Wonderful capture. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'The colors here are perfect. Wonderful capture. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-23 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128646, 6144, 3575, '<td valign="top">10!</td>', '10!', '2002-09-23 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128647, 6144, 472, '<td valign="top">interesting premise. i think that without more context though, the title might be baffling or seem whimsical.  this is a great ''time of day; shot.  good lighting and dof.  overall this shot doesnt really give me an emotional response, but it is pretty. mag99</td>', 'interesting premise. i think that without more context though, the title might be baffling or seem whimsical.  this is a great ''time of day; shot.  good lighting and dof.  overall this shot doesnt really give me an emotional response, but it is pretty. mag99', '2002-09-23 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128648, 6144, 3127, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and composition. Even the textures (the smooth sky versus the ''wrinkled'' water) are great!</td>', 'Awesome colors and composition. Even the textures (the smooth sky versus the ''wrinkled'' water) are great!', '2002-09-23 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128649, 6144, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great Job!   (hopefully more comments later)   10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great Job!   (hopefully more comments later)   10Ruthann', '2002-09-23 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128650, 6144, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice!  I love the rich orange in this sunset... the reflections in the water and the symmetry of this photo work very well... The only minor issue I see here is a little image degradation in the sky above the bridge... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler *************** Update :) - Is this Congress Avenue????? ;)</td>', 'very nice!  I love the rich orange in this sunset... the reflections in the water and the symmetry of this photo work very well... The only minor issue I see here is a little image degradation in the sky above the bridge... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler *************** Update :) - Is this Congress Avenue????? ;)', '2002-09-23 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128651, 6144, 1808, '<td valign="top">Confusing title. Nice picture.</td>', 'Confusing title. Nice picture.', '2002-09-23 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128652, 6144, 2781, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful colors!  Love this shot</td>', 'wow, beautiful colors!  Love this shot', '2002-09-24 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
