(128665, 6144, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=for bats? OMG!  Like how the sunset enhances this scene rather than being the focal point.<br/>Composition=well done. Like the choice of the figures on the bridge.<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=very good.<br/>Exposure=excellent.<br/>Interesting or Emotive=sunsets or similar lighting always elicits warm emotions for me and I''m sure others... The movement in the people and the water is also interesting.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=for bats? OMG!  Like how the sunset enhances this scene rather than being the focal point.Composition=well done. Like the choice of the figures on the bridge.Clarity (focus, details)=very good.Exposure=excellent.Interesting or Emotive=sunsets or similar lighting always elicits warm emotions for me and I''m sure others... The movement in the people and the water is also interesting.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-26 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
