(128679, 6144, 1667, '<td valign="top">I visited Austin for the first time last weekend during the Austin City Limits Festival.  I saw a bunch of people line up on a bridge out my hotel window, and couldn''t figure out why.  I stayed at the Hyatt Regency on Barton Springs.  Is this the bridge that the hotel overlooks?  I really loved Austin, by the way!</td>', 'I visited Austin for the first time last weekend during the Austin City Limits Festival.  I saw a bunch of people line up on a bridge out my hotel window, and couldn''t figure out why.  I stayed at the Hyatt Regency on Barton Springs.  Is this the bridge that the hotel overlooks?  I really loved Austin, by the way!', '2002-10-03 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
