(128718, 6145, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=wow! makes me miss Seattle.. even though I''ve only been there for a brief visit one time<br/>Composition=like a postcard (meant as a compliment)<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=excellent.. all the tiny windows can be seen!<br/>Exposure=excellent...<br/>Interesting or Emotive=interesting to view.. emotive for me because I like Seattle, but it has a wonderful quality to it.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb (Karen Bryan) :)<br/></td>', 'Initial=wow! makes me miss Seattle.. even though I''ve only been there for a brief visit one timeComposition=like a postcard (meant as a compliment)Clarity (focus, details)=excellent.. all the tiny windows can be seen!Exposure=excellent...Interesting or Emotive=interesting to view.. emotive for me because I like Seattle, but it has a wonderful quality to it.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb (Karen Bryan) :)', '2002-09-29 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
