(128903, 6158, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=fabulous!<br/>Composition=the rock in the foreground centered like that troubles me a bit, but it isn''t overwhelming. I may have wanted to wait for that sail boat to get behind the spray (caught beautifully btw), or have it appear to the right of it instead.<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=gorgeous. great movement<br/>Exposure=well done<br/>Interesting or Emotive=yes. both. :)<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=fabulous!Composition=the rock in the foreground centered like that troubles me a bit, but it isn''t overwhelming. I may have wanted to wait for that sail boat to get behind the spray (caught beautifully btw), or have it appear to the right of it instead.Clarity (focus, details)=gorgeous. great movementExposure=well doneInteresting or Emotive=yes. both. :)I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
