(128919, 6159, 2295, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you took this one.  It looks like a photo of a monitor.  The lighting is a bit dark on the subject.  Kind of hard to judge the focus since the pict is kind of grainy.  Interesting concept though.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you took this one.  It looks like a photo of a monitor.  The lighting is a bit dark on the subject.  Kind of hard to judge the focus since the pict is kind of grainy.  Interesting concept though.', '2002-09-25 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128920, 6159, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting :)  the noise and compression artifacts in this photo actually seem to add an element of "I''m tired.. i''m so tired i can''t see straight" to this photo... I must admit that you are bold if this was your intention with this photograph.  You are almost certain to be banished into the dungeons for attempting to creatively pursue a thought by creating a less than perfectly exposed and finished image... :) - setzler</td>', 'Interesting :)  the noise and compression artifacts in this photo actually seem to add an element of "I''m tired.. i''m so tired i can''t see straight" to this photo... I must admit that you are bold if this was your intention with this photograph.  You are almost certain to be banished into the dungeons for attempting to creatively pursue a thought by creating a less than perfectly exposed and finished image... :) - setzler', '2002-09-25 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
