(128927, 6159, 3138, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I find myself very distracted by the lack of stong blacks and the horrific amount of digital noise. Suggest: re-shoot and re-submit. But the idea is good, the camera angle is excellent, and it seems to me to have the potential to be a great idea for this particular challenge.  CJ</td>', 'Good shot, but I find myself very distracted by the lack of stong blacks and the horrific amount of digital noise. Suggest: re-shoot and re-submit. But the idea is good, the camera angle is excellent, and it seems to me to have the potential to be a great idea for this particular challenge.  CJ', '2002-09-28 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
