(128935, 6160, 327, '<td valign="top">Book Vault. Nice shot. The sky and trees really make this come together. Good job. Score 8 Justine.</td>', 'Book Vault. Nice shot. The sky and trees really make this come together. Good job. Score 8 Justine.', '2002-09-23 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128936, 6160, 3105, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is just a byproduct of the cloud pattern in the sky, but as I look at the rooftop the sky appears to moving to the right as if there is wind blowing!  That is really cool.  It''s nicely framed too and the colors are very realistic, as if I were there in person.  Good job.<br/>Score: 10<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'Wow!  This is just a byproduct of the cloud pattern in the sky, but as I look at the rooftop the sky appears to moving to the right as if there is wind blowing!  That is really cool.  It''s nicely framed too and the colors are very realistic, as if I were there in person.  Good job.Score: 10Courtenay', '2002-09-23 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128937, 6160, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot, you caught the sun and sky just right. DPz</td>', 'Good shot, you caught the sun and sky just right. DPz', '2002-09-23 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(128938, 6160, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  I''m glad that I''ve been there before -- otherwise I''m not sure I''d recognize it from the description!  I did a lot of studying about the JFK assassination in school, so I was really excited about visiting it a few years back.  I really like the colors of the building and how well they stand out against the sky.  I think the street signs are a bit distracting, and I may have tilted it down a bit to get more of the bottom of the building... but I still like the shot overall.</td>', 'Cool shot!  I''m glad that I''ve been there before -- otherwise I''m not sure I''d recognize it from the description!  I did a lot of studying about the JFK assassination in school, so I was really excited about visiting it a few years back.  I really like the colors of the building and how well they stand out against the sky.  I think the street signs are a bit distracting, and I may have tilted it down a bit to get more of the bottom of the building... but I still like the shot overall.', '2002-09-23 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
