(129019, 6167, 436, '<td valign="top">I like the tiles much better than the tea paraphernalia, although they might be interesting on their own.  I''ll bet the tiles are strongly colored and might''ve made a more dynamic phto in color on their own, shot up or alongside the building.  The half-seen reflections further detract from the image.  5 crisa58</td>', 'I like the tiles much better than the tea paraphernalia, although they might be interesting on their own.  I''ll bet the tiles are strongly colored and might''ve made a more dynamic phto in color on their own, shot up or alongside the building.  The half-seen reflections further detract from the image.  5 crisa58', '2002-09-23 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129020, 6167, 3532, '<td valign="top">This would have been great for the next challenge - reflections.  Technically very good, but the composition is a little busy for me.</td>', 'This would have been great for the next challenge - reflections.  Technically very good, but the composition is a little busy for me.', '2002-09-24 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
