(129022, 6167, 3859, '<td valign="top">This picture is a bit confusing to me.  I feel certain I am seeing a reflection, but of what I am not sure.  But definitely creative.</td>', 'This picture is a bit confusing to me.  I feel certain I am seeing a reflection, but of what I am not sure.  But definitely creative.', '2002-09-24 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129023, 6167, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this one inspires me too much.  It''s an interesting composition and use of a reflection, but I''m not sure either the building or the teapots compliment one another here very well...</td>', 'I''m not sure this one inspires me too much.  It''s an interesting composition and use of a reflection, but I''m not sure either the building or the teapots compliment one another here very well...', '2002-09-24 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129024, 6167, 772, '<td valign="top">I understand the capture of ''your corner of the world'' in this photo, but on the subjectivity scale, there is nothing that really grabs me and says HELLO.  The reflection on the glass and the stuff behind it showing through is a neat effect, but this image is really busy because of that.  I keep wandering around inside this image looking for something specific... something that ties me into your corner of the world... - setzler</td>', 'I understand the capture of ''your corner of the world'' in this photo, but on the subjectivity scale, there is nothing that really grabs me and says HELLO.  The reflection on the glass and the stuff behind it showing through is a neat effect, but this image is really busy because of that.  I keep wandering around inside this image looking for something specific... something that ties me into your corner of the world... - setzler', '2002-09-25 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
