(129032, 6167, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=how neat!<br/>Composition=I wonder if a different crop given the parameters required would have allowed for the left side cut off windows to be excluded... The tea sets look ghostly. :)<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=good<br/>Exposure=good<br/>Interesting or Emotive=so much to look at... It keeps me busy for a long while.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=how neat!Composition=I wonder if a different crop given the parameters required would have allowed for the left side cut off windows to be excluded... The tea sets look ghostly. :)Clarity (focus, details)=goodExposure=goodInteresting or Emotive=so much to look at... It keeps me busy for a long while.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129033, 6170, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the reflection tho the reflections are a bit bright and a little distracting. The angle is a bit weird, but I guess you were on the shore. Hmmm. It''s better than most pics here, but you don''t appear to live in a very exciting corner  ;o)   Why didn''t you climb up there and moon the camera or something? ~indigo997</td>', 'I like the colors and the reflection tho the reflections are a bit bright and a little distracting. The angle is a bit weird, but I guess you were on the shore. Hmmm. It''s better than most pics here, but you don''t appear to live in a very exciting corner  ;o)   Why didn''t you climb up there and moon the camera or something? ~indigo997', '2002-09-23 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
