(129039, 6170, 436, '<td valign="top">The reflections, especially where they dwindle, are extraordinary.  Lines of light doodled in the darkness.  The neon underglo is wonderful and still there''s detail in this very dark shot.  Nicely done.  9 crisa58</td>', 'The reflections, especially where they dwindle, are extraordinary.  Lines of light doodled in the darkness.  The neon underglo is wonderful and still there''s detail in this very dark shot.  Nicely done.  9 crisa58', '2002-09-23 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
