(129041, 6170, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections of the lights in the water, the "starburst" lights,  and the colored lights under the bridge. Composition works for me, but would have liked the sky to be a little darker.  lhall-9</td>', 'Love the reflections of the lights in the water, the "starburst" lights,  and the colored lights under the bridge. Composition works for me, but would have liked the sky to be a little darker.  lhall-9', '2002-09-23 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129042, 6170, 772, '<td valign="top">good work :)  I think the exposure on this shot is just a little hot... maybe a 1 stop decrease would fix it up a little... Also, possibly tilting the camera just a tad to the right would level up the bridge and create a little stronger diagonal with the light reflections in the water... good shot :) - setzler</td>', 'good work :)  I think the exposure on this shot is just a little hot... maybe a 1 stop decrease would fix it up a little... Also, possibly tilting the camera just a tad to the right would level up the bridge and create a little stronger diagonal with the light reflections in the water... good shot :) - setzler', '2002-09-23 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
