(129136, 6179, 2923, '<td valign="top">if you were an electron, you would submit a photo of an electrical charge, something that shows the actual activity instead of a boring motherboard which is out of focus on both ends and nothing really interesting to draw my eyes to.</td>', 'if you were an electron, you would submit a photo of an electrical charge, something that shows the actual activity instead of a boring motherboard which is out of focus on both ends and nothing really interesting to draw my eyes to.', '2002-09-25 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
