(129141, 6179, 3900, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I think you took it a step too far by saying, "If I were..." whatever sort of thing.  This is supposed to be about YOUR part of the world.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I think you took it a step too far by saying, "If I were..." whatever sort of thing.  This is supposed to be about YOUR part of the world.', '2002-09-27 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
