(129144, 6181, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent black and white... When I view this photo, I ask myself why the photographer chose to use black and white instead of color?  good shot... = 8 - jmsetzer</td>', 'excellent black and white... When I view this photo, I ask myself why the photographer chose to use black and white instead of color?  good shot... = 8 - jmsetzer', '2002-09-23 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129145, 6181, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp DPz</td>', 'Nice and sharp DPz', '2002-09-23 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129146, 6181, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Las Vegas?  I''d love to go back there -- not even so much to gamble, but just to take pictures!  I would be curious to see what the color version of this would look like, but I think it does nicely in B&amp;W too.</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Las Vegas?  I''d love to go back there -- not even so much to gamble, but just to take pictures!  I would be curious to see what the color version of this would look like, but I think it does nicely in B&W too.', '2002-09-23 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129147, 6181, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great Job!   (hopefully more comments later)   9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great Job!   (hopefully more comments later)   9Ruthann', '2002-09-23 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129148, 6181, 3818, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think I might have preferred a different angle. Not sure that having the Tropicana hotel in the pic adds to it as it seems to be two photos in one. The detail and quality of the lion and sculpture above are the more outstanding features in this photo. But, on the other hand, it looks like the lion is *defending* his territory...so six of one, half a dozen of the other here. Either way, I''ll rate it as an 8... and it''s a pretty interesting place to call *home* as well! ~Nee</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think I might have preferred a different angle. Not sure that having the Tropicana hotel in the pic adds to it as it seems to be two photos in one. The detail and quality of the lion and sculpture above are the more outstanding features in this photo. But, on the other hand, it looks like the lion is *defending* his territory...so six of one, half a dozen of the other here. Either way, I''ll rate it as an 8... and it''s a pretty interesting place to call *home* as well! ~Nee', '2002-09-24 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129149, 6181, 573, '<td valign="top">Very striking image, one of my top picks.</td>', 'Very striking image, one of my top picks.', '2002-09-25 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129150, 6181, 2587, '<td valign="top">Wow ... great exposure ... I was in Vegas not too long ago and I took a shot from almost the same angle but it was during the day and my pic does not have the same impact as yours does ... so that will bump up your score :-)</td>', 'Wow ... great exposure ... I was in Vegas not too long ago and I took a shot from almost the same angle but it was during the day and my pic does not have the same impact as yours does ... so that will bump up your score :-)', '2002-09-25 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
