(129152, 6181, 3112, '<td valign="top">VERY nice.  Only problem in composition is the hotel between lion and torch base. I would have exposed for just slightly less time.</td>', 'VERY nice.  Only problem in composition is the hotel between lion and torch base. I would have exposed for just slightly less time.', '2002-09-25 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
