(129234, 6188, 436, '<td valign="top">Who knew your corner of the world was so much better looking than mine!  And you a better photographer, too!  Very very nice.  House (and sheep) placement is just right.  The colors are rich without being overdone.  I like the way the trees draw me to the top of the photo and the house brings me back to the bottom.  <br/>9 crisa58</td>', 'Who knew your corner of the world was so much better looking than mine!  And you a better photographer, too!  Very very nice.  House (and sheep) placement is just right.  The colors are rich without being overdone.  I like the way the trees draw me to the top of the photo and the house brings me back to the bottom.  9 crisa58', '2002-09-23 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129235, 6188, 3419, '<td valign="top">This picture (that is, this country-side) is so pretty. The muted tones make me feel like I''m looking at a painting.</td>', 'This picture (that is, this country-side) is so pretty. The muted tones make me feel like I''m looking at a painting.', '2002-09-23 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
