(129239, 6188, 51, '<td valign="top">bizarre shot. i think the angle hurts this because i expect to see the horizon and i don''t, so the shot never ends up working. the land in the background however is interesting and the house is really nice. a closeup with maybe half the house would be nice. "house" used loosely.</td>', 'bizarre shot. i think the angle hurts this because i expect to see the horizon and i don''t, so the shot never ends up working. the land in the background however is interesting and the house is really nice. a closeup with maybe half the house would be nice. "house" used loosely.', '2002-09-26 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
