(129244, 6188, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=wonderful photograph!<br/>Composition=well done. The little cottage is placed in a nice area of the frame. the hillsides are leading my eye into the distance. they also work well together. Nice way to depict the expansiveness of the area<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=fairly clear and detailed...<br/>Exposure=well done<br/>Interesting or Emotive=love the feeling this image gives me: private, secluded, peaceful, calm.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=wonderful photograph!Composition=well done. The little cottage is placed in a nice area of the frame. the hillsides are leading my eye into the distance. they also work well together. Nice way to depict the expansiveness of the areaClarity (focus, details)=fairly clear and detailed...Exposure=well doneInteresting or Emotive=love the feeling this image gives me: private, secluded, peaceful, calm.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-26 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
