(129248, 6188, 2261, '<td valign="top">Brilliant landscape. Very nice picture, like the sheep and building, adds interest. I''m off to watch Emmerdale! 9-Martin</td>', 'Brilliant landscape. Very nice picture, like the sheep and building, adds interest. I''m off to watch Emmerdale! 9-Martin', '2002-09-27 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129249, 6188, 2223, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful place! maybe a bit too bright. 8 --shutterfly</td>', 'this is a beautiful place! maybe a bit too bright. 8 --shutterfly', '2002-09-27 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129250, 6188, 1037, '<td valign="top">This just oozes prettiness :). I love the colours, and I love the use of (my interpretation of) negative space to make those hills dwarf that little building. I can just hear the theme to "All Creatures Great and Small" in my head right now, and see a vision of James Herriot with his hand up a cow''s backside :). I''m giving it 10, I really love this photo - lisae</td>', 'This just oozes prettiness :). I love the colours, and I love the use of (my interpretation of) negative space to make those hills dwarf that little building. I can just hear the theme to "All Creatures Great and Small" in my head right now, and see a vision of James Herriot with his hand up a cow''s backside :). I''m giving it 10, I really love this photo - lisae', '2002-09-28 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129251, 6188, 2667, '<td valign="top">this looks like an impressionistic painting...the subdued coloration  and undulating hills create a beautiful movement in this shot. love the crofter''s cottage and stone fence in the foreground leading me up into the hills. wonderful shot! (10)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'this looks like an impressionistic painting...the subdued coloration  and undulating hills create a beautiful movement in this shot. love the crofter''s cottage and stone fence in the foreground leading me up into the hills. wonderful shot! (10)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-28 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129252, 6188, 3454, '<td valign="top">Great subject and composition, looks like a little levels would have filled in some blacks.</td>', 'Great subject and composition, looks like a little levels would have filled in some blacks.', '2002-09-29 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129253, 6188, 3959, '<td valign="top">19th out of 245. Niot bad, Dazz.... However I think this is a better picture than the score reflects, just great picture. I voterd this second or third place....</td>', '19th out of 245. Niot bad, Dazz.... However I think this is a better picture than the score reflects, just great picture. I voterd this second or third place....', '2002-09-30 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(129254, 6189, 1143, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting situation. The shaded areas are a little underexposed and you should get a polarizing filter to cut down on that water glare. You should have gone back later in the day for more even lighting. I like the composition. It''s an interesting view with the angles. Overall, a few technical problems and the subject doesnt have a lot of emotional pull with me, but it''s an attractive pic and a nice little view into your world - very Euro.  ~indi</td>', 'Tough lighting situation. The shaded areas are a little underexposed and you should get a polarizing filter to cut down on that water glare. You should have gone back later in the day for more even lighting. I like the composition. It''s an interesting view with the angles. Overall, a few technical problems and the subject doesnt have a lot of emotional pull with me, but it''s an attractive pic and a nice little view into your world - very Euro.  ~indi', '2002-09-23 05:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129255, 6189, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, good perspective and leading lines. Very British aswell :) I like the saturated colours, only gripe is the blown out reflection of the sun (in england?) on the water.. <br/> 8 (may be bumped later, keep your eye out on the comment)<br/>-Konador<br/><br/>UPDATE - 9 :)</td>', 'Very nice photo, good perspective and leading lines. Very British aswell :) I like the saturated colours, only gripe is the blown out reflection of the sun (in england?) on the water..  8 (may be bumped later, keep your eye out on the comment)-KonadorUPDATE - 9 :)', '2002-09-23 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129256, 6189, 327, '<td valign="top">And a wonderful day. Wow the water is so nice with the light. GOOD. Score 7Justine.</td>', 'And a wonderful day. Wow the water is so nice with the light. GOOD. Score 7Justine.', '2002-09-23 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129257, 6189, 3112, '<td valign="top">Very difficult photo to expose properly.   Well done.  I can''t wait to read your description of this scene.</td>', 'Very difficult photo to expose properly.   Well done.  I can''t wait to read your description of this scene.', '2002-09-23 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129258, 6189, 3313, '<td valign="top">I like the picture except that I would have cropped off the boring buildings, but then it might not be the corner of your world as much. It''s a difficult challenge to mark :-(<br/>6 marcvg</td>', 'I like the picture except that I would have cropped off the boring buildings, but then it might not be the corner of your world as much. It''s a difficult challenge to mark :-(6 marcvg', '2002-09-23 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
