(129380, 6198, 3655, '<td valign="top">nice!!! 9</td>', 'nice!!! 9', '2002-09-27 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129381, 6198, 3138, '<td valign="top">What can I tell you? It''s a good, strong, graphically simple image. But perhaps too simple, somewhat lacking in what Freeman Patterson use to call "dynamic tension." Perhaps sticking a few human fingers in there pressing the keys would provide the necessary tension to really make it a great shot. Just a thought. CJ</td>', 'What can I tell you? It''s a good, strong, graphically simple image. But perhaps too simple, somewhat lacking in what Freeman Patterson use to call "dynamic tension." Perhaps sticking a few human fingers in there pressing the keys would provide the necessary tension to really make it a great shot. Just a thought. CJ', '2002-09-28 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129382, 6198, 4202, '<td valign="top">Good job. I , of course, know what it is and the design element is pure and well stated.</td>', 'Good job. I , of course, know what it is and the design element is pure and well stated.', '2002-09-28 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129383, 6198, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this a lot.  I''m not sure whether this says much about "your corner," but it''s a nice macro.</td>', 'Overall I like this a lot.  I''m not sure whether this says much about "your corner," but it''s a nice macro.', '2002-09-28 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129384, 6198, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-09-29 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129385, 6198, 3072, '<td valign="top">This is a great corner, the photo is good.</td>', 'This is a great corner, the photo is good.', '2002-09-29 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129386, 6198, 2323, '<td valign="top">Very nice... has an art-gallery type feel to it.   --8-- sohr</td>', 'Very nice... has an art-gallery type feel to it.   --8-- sohr', '2002-09-29 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129387, 6198, 573, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.</td>', 'Great contrast.', '2002-09-29 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129388, 6201, 3084, '<td valign="top">I too am from Toronto and considered the CN Tower as a good example of our city.  You did a very good job of making a static image come alive with motion.  Shooting from the Queen''s Quay makes for a different angle compared to what you typically see of this structure.  You know what they say, "Toronto has the world''s biggest erection!" - 9 Morgan</td>', 'I too am from Toronto and considered the CN Tower as a good example of our city.  You did a very good job of making a static image come alive with motion.  Shooting from the Queen''s Quay makes for a different angle compared to what you typically see of this structure.  You know what they say, "Toronto has the world''s biggest erection!" - 9 Morgan', '2002-09-23 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129389, 6201, 3002, '<td valign="top">I like the way the movement of the camera makes that tower thingy look as if its bending by the wind force of the passing bus.</td>', 'I like the way the movement of the camera makes that tower thingy look as if its bending by the wind force of the passing bus.', '2002-09-23 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129390, 6201, 3994, '<td valign="top">I like the effect.  It almost looks like the tower is bending because it''s moving at high speed.  Nice idea!</td>', 'I like the effect.  It almost looks like the tower is bending because it''s moving at high speed.  Nice idea!', '2002-09-23 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129391, 6201, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good concept, nice angle</td>', 'Good concept, nice angle', '2002-09-23 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129392, 6201, 3911, '<td valign="top">Great composition, movnig train ... I like it very much</td>', 'Great composition, movnig train ... I like it very much', '2002-09-23 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129393, 6201, 3898, '<td valign="top">I''m getting motion sicknes just looking at it. Its great.</td>', 'I''m getting motion sicknes just looking at it. Its great.', '2002-09-23 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129394, 6201, 2814, '<td valign="top">I was there too, eh!</td>', 'I was there too, eh!', '2002-09-23 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129395, 6201, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow...how''d you do that?</td>', 'Wow...how''d you do that?', '2002-09-23 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129396, 6201, 3448, '<td valign="top">Whoa!</td>', 'Whoa!', '2002-09-23 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129397, 6201, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice curve effect!</td>', 'Nice curve effect!', '2002-09-23 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129398, 6201, 1569, '<td valign="top">Windy    eh?</td>', 'Windy    eh?', '2002-09-23 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129399, 6201, 3859, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s definitely original! . I do like the way the tower curves off to the top corner, I like the red color on the bus, I''m just not sure about the slanting of the picture. It leave me feeling a little dizzy.</td>', 'Well, it''s definitely original! . I do like the way the tower curves off to the top corner, I like the red color on the bus, I''m just not sure about the slanting of the picture. It leave me feeling a little dizzy.', '2002-09-24 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129400, 6201, 3419, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle for this shot. I like how you caught the TTC bus (streetcar) in the foreground. And the angle of the tower suggests that it is "bending with the wind", but it doesn''t really do that, right? Did you use Perspective to distort the picture? Is that allowed for the DP challenge?</td>', 'Interesting angle for this shot. I like how you caught the TTC bus (streetcar) in the foreground. And the angle of the tower suggests that it is "bending with the wind", but it doesn''t really do that, right? Did you use Perspective to distort the picture? Is that allowed for the DP challenge?', '2002-09-24 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129401, 6201, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting bend... the little ''triangle'' clip at the top right looks a little strange... maybe that''s a distortion from glass... :) - setzler</td>', 'Interesting bend... the little ''triangle'' clip at the top right looks a little strange... maybe that''s a distortion from glass... :) - setzler', '2002-09-24 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129402, 6201, 1827, '<td valign="top">Neat.  Is that tower really leaning or is that an illusion created by movement?  Neat either way.  The angle was a GREAT choice, it really enhances the movement and the leaning angle of the tower.  In places there seems to be a bit of glare, so I''m wondering if this was taken through a window...  The triangle in the upper right corner in particular is distracting.  You may know this and have captured this in a frenzied moment, but just in case, I mention that a polarizing lens can help eliminate glare when photographing through glass.  Good shot.  8, just-married</td>', 'Neat.  Is that tower really leaning or is that an illusion created by movement?  Neat either way.  The angle was a GREAT choice, it really enhances the movement and the leaning angle of the tower.  In places there seems to be a bit of glare, so I''m wondering if this was taken through a window...  The triangle in the upper right corner in particular is distracting.  You may know this and have captured this in a frenzied moment, but just in case, I mention that a polarizing lens can help eliminate glare when photographing through glass.  Good shot.  8, just-married', '2002-09-25 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129403, 6201, 3599, '<td valign="top">This would be great for this weeks challenge too.  I like this one.</td>', 'This would be great for this weeks challenge too.  I like this one.', '2002-09-25 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129404, 6201, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the vehicle moving at the bottom.  I don''t like the needle thing looking like its bent like a banana.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the vehicle moving at the bottom.  I don''t like the needle thing looking like its bent like a banana.', '2002-09-26 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129405, 6201, 3860, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2002-09-26 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
