(129436, 6204, 2472, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, it''s too white around the subject, and the shadow from the spider could have been sharper, on focus and intensely dark, which would provide a very interesting result. It is basically a question of ilumination technique, which is the best kept secret of photography.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, it''s too white around the subject, and the shadow from the spider could have been sharper, on focus and intensely dark, which would provide a very interesting result. It is basically a question of ilumination technique, which is the best kept secret of photography.', '2002-09-26 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
