(129475, 6207, 3280, '<td valign="top">I can see where it got it''s name, good composition and lighting.  I am drawn up the Creek.  Overall, an excellent shot.  DPz</td>', 'I can see where it got it''s name, good composition and lighting.  I am drawn up the Creek.  Overall, an excellent shot.  DPz', '2002-09-23 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129476, 6207, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this, especially the overall "feel" of it, and the color (or non-color!).  I also like the range of dark and light.  Had it been my shot, I have to admit that I would have taken the shot by moving my framing up about a third from the bottom, making my bottom frame right below where the rocks become tightly packed together, (just enough to show water), and would have tried to show more of the height of the trees.  lhall-9</td>', 'I like this, especially the overall "feel" of it, and the color (or non-color!).  I also like the range of dark and light.  Had it been my shot, I have to admit that I would have taken the shot by moving my framing up about a third from the bottom, making my bottom frame right below where the rocks become tightly packed together, (just enough to show water), and would have tried to show more of the height of the trees.  lhall-9', '2002-09-23 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
