(129569, 6211, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool sky, but I don''t get a sense of place from this. If there was a bit more landscape I would give it a 10, but I''ll have to take it down a point I think. I don''t mark down a lot for that kind of thing, but it''s a shame... as a standalone photo this is beautiful. I can see a slight indication of the buildings there on the horizon, but just not enough... oh well, 9 will have to do :) - lisae</td>', 'That''s a really cool sky, but I don''t get a sense of place from this. If there was a bit more landscape I would give it a 10, but I''ll have to take it down a point I think. I don''t mark down a lot for that kind of thing, but it''s a shame... as a standalone photo this is beautiful. I can see a slight indication of the buildings there on the horizon, but just not enough... oh well, 9 will have to do :) - lisae', '2002-09-28 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
