(129591, 6214, 2472, '<td valign="top">In my humble personal opinion I think this image is not inspiring. It''s neither in nor out of the store, and it ends up telling me that the main character here is the soft drinks. Soft drinks cannot be your corner of the world. Technically it lacks focus. What item is the central point of attention: the cans, the bottles, the cooler shelves, or the reflection of the people on the stores window?</td>', 'In my humble personal opinion I think this image is not inspiring. It''s neither in nor out of the store, and it ends up telling me that the main character here is the soft drinks. Soft drinks cannot be your corner of the world. Technically it lacks focus. What item is the central point of attention: the cans, the bottles, the cooler shelves, or the reflection of the people on the stores window?', '2002-09-24 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
