(129620, 6215, 3765, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic, looks like infrared. What filters did you use. It is eerie on the one hand but also has a fairy-tale setting about it. Good job. <br/></td>', 'This is fantastic, looks like infrared. What filters did you use. It is eerie on the one hand but also has a fairy-tale setting about it. Good job. ', '2002-09-25 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
