(129622, 6215, 3138, '<td valign="top">Having spend 5 summers shooting infrared landscapes some years ago, I admit having a weak spot for infrared images. Good work with this one.</td>', 'Having spend 5 summers shooting infrared landscapes some years ago, I admit having a weak spot for infrared images. Good work with this one.', '2002-09-26 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
