(129642, 6215, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=something out of the Lord of the Rings maybe? :)<br/>Composition=good<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=good<br/>Exposure=cool. well done<br/>Interesting or Emotive=interesting.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=something out of the Lord of the Rings maybe? :)Composition=goodClarity (focus, details)=goodExposure=cool. well doneInteresting or Emotive=interesting.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
