(129792, 6227, 811, '<td valign="top">OMG, I had that same "design" when i was in high school.  Now I have a chest, bedside table and bedframe.  AND this looks just like my room when i lived at home, and my house now that i''m married!  karmat</td>', 'OMG, I had that same "design" when i was in high school.  Now I have a chest, bedside table and bedframe.  AND this looks just like my room when i lived at home, and my house now that i''m married!  karmat', '2002-09-23 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129793, 6227, 156, '<td valign="top">i absolutely love this</td>', 'i absolutely love this', '2002-09-23 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129794, 6227, 2997, '<td valign="top">Since the challenge is so open-ended I can''t say this doesn''t qualify.  So here is what I would recommend for improvements:<br/>1. The "Horizon" is not level.<br/>2. Everything seems just slightly out of focus (I have the same problem.)<br/>On the positive side, you have very good lighting in this picture.</td>', 'Since the challenge is so open-ended I can''t say this doesn''t qualify.  So here is what I would recommend for improvements:1. The "Horizon" is not level.2. Everything seems just slightly out of focus (I have the same problem.)On the positive side, you have very good lighting in this picture.', '2002-09-23 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129795, 6227, 637, '<td valign="top">I like the way the pink color dominates everything; not just the walls.  I like the unselfconscious honesty of this image 7 sjgleah</td>', 'I like the way the pink color dominates everything; not just the walls.  I like the unselfconscious honesty of this image 7 sjgleah', '2002-09-24 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129796, 6227, 3102, '<td valign="top">May have been better to focus more tightly on the dresser (leaving the doors out).  Could have worked well as a vertical shot, perhaps.  Nice colors and idea, though!</td>', 'May have been better to focus more tightly on the dresser (leaving the doors out).  Could have worked well as a vertical shot, perhaps.  Nice colors and idea, though!', '2002-09-24 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129797, 6227, 3532, '<td valign="top">This picture would have been better if you picked your frame with a little more care - maybe you could have gotten in a little closer to the dresser, maybe taken a portrait rather than landscape shot.</td>', 'This picture would have been better if you picked your frame with a little more care - maybe you could have gotten in a little closer to the dresser, maybe taken a portrait rather than landscape shot.', '2002-09-25 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129798, 6227, 772, '<td valign="top">I understand the capture of ''your corner of the world'' in this photo, but on the subjectivity scale, there is nothing that really grabs me and says HELLO.  The ''clutter'' seems to work nicely...  the doors, especially since they are not straight in the frame also add to that sense of clutter... - setzler</td>', 'I understand the capture of ''your corner of the world'' in this photo, but on the subjectivity scale, there is nothing that really grabs me and says HELLO.  The ''clutter'' seems to work nicely...  the doors, especially since they are not straight in the frame also add to that sense of clutter... - setzler', '2002-09-25 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(129799, 6227, 4173, '<td valign="top">I am rating this shot lower becuase this scene is not specific to your corner of the world.  I can see the same setting here is CA.  Does not fully meet the unique possibilities of the challenge</td>', 'I am rating this shot lower becuase this scene is not specific to your corner of the world.  I can see the same setting here is CA.  Does not fully meet the unique possibilities of the challenge', '2002-09-25 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
