(129842, 6230, 1041, '<td valign="top">i love skylines and water, and this is a very nice nightshot of both.  the yellows look warm and inviting and are nicely reflected in the water.  the sillhouettes of the people adds to the scale of things.  i can almost imagine myself sitting there with them, philosophising about life and such.<br/>challenge met -- yes<br/>composition / appeal -- good<br/>technical -- good<br/>overall -- 9<br/>gr8photos   :)</td>', 'i love skylines and water, and this is a very nice nightshot of both.  the yellows look warm and inviting and are nicely reflected in the water.  the sillhouettes of the people adds to the scale of things.  i can almost imagine myself sitting there with them, philosophising about life and such.challenge met -- yescomposition / appeal -- goodtechnical -- goodoverall -- 9gr8photos   :)', '2002-09-24 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
