(129882, 6231, 1041, '<td valign="top">fall ... my favorite time of year here in virginia where i currently live.  your photo makes me look forward to taking fall photos (leaves haven''t quite turned yet).<br/><br/>challenge met -- yes<br/>composition / appeal -- good.  i like how the laves seem to point out of the frame, and how you''ve included 3 partial leaves. <br/>technical -- good, love the colors, and the blurry background which is just blurry enough to set off the leaves that are the subject but yet you can still distinguish the individual leaves in the background.<br/>overall -- 8<br/>gr8photos   :)</td>', 'fall ... my favorite time of year here in virginia where i currently live.  your photo makes me look forward to taking fall photos (leaves haven''t quite turned yet).challenge met -- yescomposition / appeal -- good.  i like how the laves seem to point out of the frame, and how you''ve included 3 partial leaves. technical -- good, love the colors, and the blurry background which is just blurry enough to set off the leaves that are the subject but yet you can still distinguish the individual leaves in the background.overall -- 8gr8photos   :)', '2002-09-24 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
