(130003, 6240, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=calming. mysterious. heartening.<br/>Composition=good. there are 4 horses, but the eye immediately sees 3, and the fence line is in a nice position<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=well done. I can even see deep into the mist in the distant trees.<br/>Exposure=good- done well<br/>Interesting or Emotive=interesting and emotive.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=calming. mysterious. heartening.Composition=good. there are 4 horses, but the eye immediately sees 3, and the fence line is in a nice positionClarity (focus, details)=well done. I can even see deep into the mist in the distant trees.Exposure=good- done wellInteresting or Emotive=interesting and emotive.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-26 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130004, 6240, 2587, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pic ... my only recommendation ... get on your knees and try it from a lower angle ... the leaves are a bit too close to the horses and it draws the eye to those points ... other than that ... great mood in this photo</td>', 'Beautiful pic ... my only recommendation ... get on your knees and try it from a lower angle ... the leaves are a bit too close to the horses and it draws the eye to those points ... other than that ... great mood in this photo', '2002-09-27 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130005, 6240, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the green and the fog.  Beautiful horses, too, if i might add. karmat</td>', 'I like the contrast of the green and the fog.  Beautiful horses, too, if i might add. karmat', '2002-09-27 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
