(130008, 6240, 3178, '<td valign="top">This is kind of nice, and I like the misty field with horses thing. But the shot doesn''t really work for me. Maybe because the horse on the right is moving off? Or the foreground trees are too strong? Or the horizon isn''t level? I''m really not sure if it''s any or all of these, but I feel like there''s a more engaging shot there somewhere. 5 - chrisab.</td>', 'This is kind of nice, and I like the misty field with horses thing. But the shot doesn''t really work for me. Maybe because the horse on the right is moving off? Or the foreground trees are too strong? Or the horizon isn''t level? I''m really not sure if it''s any or all of these, but I feel like there''s a more engaging shot there somewhere. 5 - chrisab.', '2002-09-29 04:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
