(130018, 6241, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good Gull shot.  It''s really hard to get them to face you when pointing the camera, isn''t it?  I really like the focus here and the way you have shown the detail in feathers and the shine of the eye.  He actually looks a little preturbed.  =10 syamjonimi ;''-D</td>', 'Good Gull shot.  It''s really hard to get them to face you when pointing the camera, isn''t it?  I really like the focus here and the way you have shown the detail in feathers and the shine of the eye.  He actually looks a little preturbed.  =10 syamjonimi ;''-D', '2002-09-25 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130019, 6241, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice :)  If this would have been my subject, i bet i would have spent hours trying to get just the perfect shot... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice :)  If this would have been my subject, i bet i would have spent hours trying to get just the perfect shot... good work :) - setzler', '2002-09-26 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
