(130235, 6254, 2923, '<td valign="top">Colorado Springs!!!!!  I spent two years in my childhood there (ages 13-15).  That must be the Garden of the Gods in the foreground?   Nicely done.  9 paganini</td>', 'Colorado Springs!!!!!  I spent two years in my childhood there (ages 13-15).  That must be the Garden of the Gods in the foreground?   Nicely done.  9 paganini', '2002-09-29 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130236, 6254, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=nice and clear and bright<br/>Composition=the big rock formation in the foreground stops my eye.. There isn''t a smooth transition to the distant peak<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=beautifully done<br/>Exposure=equally beautiful<br/>Interesting or Emotive=fair<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=nice and clear and brightComposition=the big rock formation in the foreground stops my eye.. There isn''t a smooth transition to the distant peakClarity (focus, details)=beautifully doneExposure=equally beautifulInteresting or Emotive=fairI am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130237, 6255, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- where the heck is that?  :)  Interesting sign, perhaps a little too busy below.  It would have been interesting to see it with the camera tilted down enough to eliminate the cranes.</td>', 'Wow -- where the heck is that?  :)  Interesting sign, perhaps a little too busy below.  It would have been interesting to see it with the camera tilted down enough to eliminate the cranes.', '2002-09-23 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130238, 6255, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work...where is this? Good luck to you. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice work...where is this? Good luck to you. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-23 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130239, 6255, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/><br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-25 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130240, 6255, 4239, '<td valign="top">great sign but picture...</td>', 'great sign but picture...', '2002-09-28 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130241, 6255, 2221, '<td valign="top">Well... just four comments... seems the photo really sucked. I agree that it''s not a great shot, it was more the theme I tried to convey. See the photo details for an explanation. But even that didn''t came across. I thought that most people will recognise the sign and associate it with the history it stands for. Well... apparently not.<br/><br/>I chose this photo of the series _because_ it was busy. I wanted to show the contrast of all the trouble in the history (represented by the sign) and the normality today (represented by the street scene). In all the other photos I took at this location there were tourists staring at the sign and photographing like me ;-) I liked how the people walk normally over the street now when some years ago there was the Berlin wall with fences, army guards etc at this place. I also didn''t want to remove the cranes because they somehow added to this picture (in my opinion). They show todays progress and development at the former broder areas.<br/><br/>Anyway 5.2 is actually a good score for this photo, I just would have liked more comments to see how other people think about it and if it was possible to see the things I had in mind when taking the photo.<br/></td>', 'Well... just four comments... seems the photo really sucked. I agree that it''s not a great shot, it was more the theme I tried to convey. See the photo details for an explanation. But even that didn''t came across. I thought that most people will recognise the sign and associate it with the history it stands for. Well... apparently not.I chose this photo of the series _because_ it was busy. I wanted to show the contrast of all the trouble in the history (represented by the sign) and the normality today (represented by the street scene). In all the other photos I took at this location there were tourists staring at the sign and photographing like me ;-) I liked how the people walk normally over the street now when some years ago there was the Berlin wall with fences, army guards etc at this place. I also didn''t want to remove the cranes because they somehow added to this picture (in my opinion). They show todays progress and development at the former broder areas.Anyway 5.2 is actually a good score for this photo, I just would have liked more comments to see how other people think about it and if it was possible to see the things I had in mind when taking the photo.', '2002-09-30 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130242, 6256, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good image, but the strip on the right side of the frame is a bit distracting from your subject... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think this is a very good image, but the strip on the right side of the frame is a bit distracting from your subject... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-23 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130243, 6256, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice details -- great colors, too!</td>', 'Nice details -- great colors, too!', '2002-09-23 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130244, 6256, 1135, '<td valign="top">To me the little bit of blue on the right is distracting but I still like the photo, nice color.</td>', 'To me the little bit of blue on the right is distracting but I still like the photo, nice color.', '2002-09-23 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130245, 6256, 327, '<td valign="top">Would of liked the right cropped tighter.....still I like this, .....it''s homey. Good luck. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Would of liked the right cropped tighter.....still I like this, .....it''s homey. Good luck. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-23 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130246, 6256, 3541, '<td valign="top">This pic is a little off center on the cropping but has a very familiar feel to it....Nice work mom i give it a ten!<br/>Melissa</td>', 'This pic is a little off center on the cropping but has a very familiar feel to it....Nice work mom i give it a ten!Melissa', '2002-09-23 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130247, 6256, 436, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought hey what''s that blue edge doing there.  Bet that should''ve been cropped out.  Now I like it more and more.  The knocker is stunning.  The framing is exactly right...even with the blue edge.  It''s beautiful and beautifully done.  9 crisa58</td>', 'At first, I thought hey what''s that blue edge doing there.  Bet that should''ve been cropped out.  Now I like it more and more.  The knocker is stunning.  The framing is exactly right...even with the blue edge.  It''s beautiful and beautifully done.  9 crisa58', '2002-09-23 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130248, 6256, 2182, '<td valign="top">Good job, excellent title</td>', 'Good job, excellent title', '2002-09-23 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130249, 6256, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t doubt it was intentional, but the off center crop doesn''t seem to add anything</td>', 'I don''t doubt it was intentional, but the off center crop doesn''t seem to add anything', '2002-09-24 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130250, 6256, 3273, '<td valign="top">Would have been better centered in the image.  But maybe there was something to the left which you didn''t want to include.</td>', 'Would have been better centered in the image.  But maybe there was something to the left which you didn''t want to include.', '2002-09-24 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130251, 6256, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, although it lacks that *something* that would make me rate it higher.  Can''t say that there is anything I would do differently though!  Moderate to high visual impact for me.  lhall-8</td>', 'Love this shot, although it lacks that *something* that would make me rate it higher.  Can''t say that there is anything I would do differently though!  Moderate to high visual impact for me.  lhall-8', '2002-09-24 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130252, 6256, 92, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. I love the meaning and I love the subject. It has that Americana red white and blue that just works ! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I love this photo. I love the meaning and I love the subject. It has that Americana red white and blue that just works ! Shiiizzzam', '2002-09-24 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130253, 6256, 2777, '<td valign="top">That something in the bottom left is distracting.</td>', 'That something in the bottom left is distracting.', '2002-09-24 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130254, 6256, 4143, '<td valign="top">Good</td>', 'Good', '2002-09-24 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130255, 6256, 3730, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots this week...great job..what would I have done differently? Well, if possible, I would get rid of whatever those dark lines are on the lower left, and, if possible, I would try and get a bit more of the blue on the right...but, what do I know :) -9 zadore</td>', 'One of my favorite shots this week...great job..what would I have done differently? Well, if possible, I would get rid of whatever those dark lines are on the lower left, and, if possible, I would try and get a bit more of the blue on the right...but, what do I know :) -9 zadore', '2002-09-25 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130256, 6256, 1829, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject and composition.  I would however, crop out the dark edge on the left and take out that twig on the right (IMO).  Overall a fantastic homely photo - 9 :)</td>', 'Lovely subject and composition.  I would however, crop out the dark edge on the left and take out that twig on the right (IMO).  Overall a fantastic homely photo - 9 :)', '2002-09-25 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
