(130273, 6258, 3080, '<td valign="top">The first time I have ever seen this structure, and I see it twice in one week! Strange.  The other photo was on photosig, and involved some nudes standing right in front of it. LOL.  Anyway, I like this one much better.  It is very beautiful, and I almost wish to see more detail in it, however your angle is good, to get the road in it as well.  The lighting is also good, and I really like the subject matter.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The first time I have ever seen this structure, and I see it twice in one week! Strange.  The other photo was on photosig, and involved some nudes standing right in front of it. LOL.  Anyway, I like this one much better.  It is very beautiful, and I almost wish to see more detail in it, however your angle is good, to get the road in it as well.  The lighting is also good, and I really like the subject matter.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-23 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
