(130378, 6260, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! I like it a lot for its creative title. A bit too blurred which makes it hard to recognise as a corner of your flat. I''m really curious to know if that''s really a corner of your flat or just some scribbled lines on paper. I hope you''re still alive next week to tell us...</td>', 'Nice photo! I like it a lot for its creative title. A bit too blurred which makes it hard to recognise as a corner of your flat. I''m really curious to know if that''s really a corner of your flat or just some scribbled lines on paper. I hope you''re still alive next week to tell us...', '2002-09-29 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130379, 6260, 806, '<td valign="top">The title elicits emotion, but the image doesn''t make sense without the title...</td>', 'The title elicits emotion, but the image doesn''t make sense without the title...', '2002-09-29 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130380, 6260, 47, '<td valign="top">down not across</td>', 'down not across', '2002-09-30 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130381, 6261, 2000, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite getting the point of this, with the distortion.  I''ll give you credit for creativity, but I don''t think that creativity in the process was critical here - just in the shot itself.  -MC</td>', 'I''m not quite getting the point of this, with the distortion.  I''ll give you credit for creativity, but I don''t think that creativity in the process was critical here - just in the shot itself.  -MC', '2002-09-23 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
