(130392, 6261, 3320, '<td valign="top">Do not know how you did it but I like that a lot. Very nice ''painting colors''. Not that much to say, I like it. 8. Lionel</td>', 'Do not know how you did it but I like that a lot. Very nice ''painting colors''. Not that much to say, I like it. 8. Lionel', '2002-09-25 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
