(130397, 6261, 3102, '<td valign="top">Um... San Francisco falling into the bay?  :)  Very clever shot -- cool title, too.  I''m interested in learning what you used to get this reflection!</td>', 'Um... San Francisco falling into the bay?  :)  Very clever shot -- cool title, too.  I''m interested in learning what you used to get this reflection!', '2002-09-28 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
