(130400, 6262, 327, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit too bright/glare too strong. The flowers on the other hand are lovely with the mirror reflection. Nice. Good luck. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Light is a bit too bright/glare too strong. The flowers on the other hand are lovely with the mirror reflection. Nice. Good luck. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-23 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130401, 6262, 4049, '<td valign="top">Overexposed on the right side.</td>', 'Overexposed on the right side.', '2002-09-23 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130402, 6262, 2814, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think the lamp is shining too much light, it makes the color in the flower dull.</td>', 'Nice, but I think the lamp is shining too much light, it makes the color in the flower dull.', '2002-09-23 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130403, 6262, 3280, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, you should be ready to go for reflections!  Might have been better with a bit less on the left side.  DPz</td>', 'Interesting shot, you should be ready to go for reflections!  Might have been better with a bit less on the left side.  DPz', '2002-09-23 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130404, 6262, 2472, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, there are far too many subjects in front of the mirror and around it. The light from the left does not provide a desirable contrast and feel, because it is too intense and it "burned" the objects. The composition is unbalanced and too crammed. The title is not very important, but this image, as cropped, does not relate me to a dining room. All of the objects got partially cropped out: the jar, pine cones, lamp, flower vase, mirror and picture frames.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, there are far too many subjects in front of the mirror and around it. The light from the left does not provide a desirable contrast and feel, because it is too intense and it "burned" the objects. The composition is unbalanced and too crammed. The title is not very important, but this image, as cropped, does not relate me to a dining room. All of the objects got partially cropped out: the jar, pine cones, lamp, flower vase, mirror and picture frames.', '2002-09-24 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130405, 6262, 3859, '<td valign="top">The light or the reflection of the light is a bit harsh.  Makes the center of the picture washed out.</td>', 'The light or the reflection of the light is a bit harsh.  Makes the center of the picture washed out.', '2002-09-24 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130406, 6262, 4175, '<td valign="top">Great for ''Reflections'', if that''s a window.........</td>', 'Great for ''Reflections'', if that''s a window.........', '2002-09-25 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130407, 6262, 2798, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better in portrait. Also seems a little over exposed. Good choice of subject though - this undoubtedly your corner of the world.6 - floyd</td>', 'I think this would have looked better in portrait. Also seems a little over exposed. Good choice of subject though - this undoubtedly your corner of the world.6 - floyd', '2002-09-28 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130408, 6262, 3102, '<td valign="top">A little too busy for my tastes.  I would have liked to have seen this cropped with just the flowers and the mirror.  The lamp and photo seem a bit washed out, while the item beside the mirror is left in the dark.</td>', 'A little too busy for my tastes.  I would have liked to have seen this cropped with just the flowers and the mirror.  The lamp and photo seem a bit washed out, while the item beside the mirror is left in the dark.', '2002-09-28 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130409, 6262, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-29 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130410, 6262, 3072, '<td valign="top">I love your corner, but in some areas the light is too harsh.</td>', 'I love your corner, but in some areas the light is too harsh.', '2002-09-29 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130411, 6262, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the pastel feeling.</td>', 'I like the pastel feeling.', '2002-09-30 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
