(130567, 6270, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=beautiful!<br/>Composition=Nice position to photograph this subject.<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=nice detail even to the near distance.<br/>Exposure=well done. nice choice of time of day to photo<br/>Interesting or Emotive=very intersting to look at. The curves of the shoreline add movement<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=beautiful!Composition=Nice position to photograph this subject.Clarity (focus, details)=nice detail even to the near distance.Exposure=well done. nice choice of time of day to photoInteresting or Emotive=very intersting to look at. The curves of the shoreline add movementI am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-26 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
