(130569, 6270, 3178, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I think it''s a little over exposed for my taste. The sky is too bright for a night shot, and some of the brighter lights are overblown to the point of distraction. But the reflection on the river is very nice, and the colors are good. 7 - chrisab.</td>', 'This is nice. I think it''s a little over exposed for my taste. The sky is too bright for a night shot, and some of the brighter lights are overblown to the point of distraction. But the reflection on the river is very nice, and the colors are good. 7 - chrisab.', '2002-09-28 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
