(130573, 6270, 2009, '<td valign="top">The lights make it look like the city is airborn hovering on jets. Beautiful colors.</td>', 'The lights make it look like the city is airborn hovering on jets. Beautiful colors.', '2002-09-29 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130574, 6270, 3102, '<td valign="top">A couple "post-voting" comments... I shot this just after the sun went down.  A few folks mentioned that they would have liked it had the sky been darker, but my past experience with this vantage point in particular is that the buildings get lost in a black sky.  This was shot on a fairly hazy night (one of only a few favorable nights to shoot that week), so the contrast was tweaked a little higher than I had hoped.  It''s nice to give folks a glimpse of our city, and to show people that it''s not quite as smoky and gritty as it used to be!</td>', 'A couple "post-voting" comments... I shot this just after the sun went down.  A few folks mentioned that they would have liked it had the sky been darker, but my past experience with this vantage point in particular is that the buildings get lost in a black sky.  This was shot on a fairly hazy night (one of only a few favorable nights to shoot that week), so the contrast was tweaked a little higher than I had hoped.  It''s nice to give folks a glimpse of our city, and to show people that it''s not quite as smoky and gritty as it used to be!', '2002-09-30 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130575, 6270, 3913, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 9 placement!</td>', 'Congrats on your 9 placement!', '2002-10-01 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
