(130580, 6272, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''ve always thought this was the most gorgeous place!  We wanted to get married in the old Chapel on the lake at Lake Junaluska.  This is a wonderful shot of your area, and I love your composition.  Also like that it is an overcast day. (Don''t think I''ve ever gotten a shot in the Smokies without clouds in it!) Can''t be sure if you saturated a little, but if so, it really works - if not, then Wow! it is absolutely beautiful there right now. lhall-8</td>', 'I''ve always thought this was the most gorgeous place!  We wanted to get married in the old Chapel on the lake at Lake Junaluska.  This is a wonderful shot of your area, and I love your composition.  Also like that it is an overcast day. (Don''t think I''ve ever gotten a shot in the Smokies without clouds in it!) Can''t be sure if you saturated a little, but if so, it really works - if not, then Wow! it is absolutely beautiful there right now. lhall-8', '2002-09-24 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130581, 6272, 3317, '<td valign="top">it''s pretty, not overly spectacular though, maybe should''ve caught a sunrise or sunset. or maybe a dusk shot with the moon shining in the water. it''s a perfectly good picture, just not the most compelling ever.</td>', 'it''s pretty, not overly spectacular though, maybe should''ve caught a sunrise or sunset. or maybe a dusk shot with the moon shining in the water. it''s a perfectly good picture, just not the most compelling ever.', '2002-09-25 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
