(130613, 6274, 1826, '<td valign="top">A heavenly corner of the world. :)</td>', 'A heavenly corner of the world. :)', '2002-09-27 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130614, 6274, 4182, '<td valign="top">this looks like it was made for a brochure</td>', 'this looks like it was made for a brochure', '2002-09-27 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130615, 6274, 2223, '<td valign="top">now this is where id like to live!!! what a beautiful shot. 9--shutterfly</td>', 'now this is where id like to live!!! what a beautiful shot. 9--shutterfly', '2002-09-27 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130616, 6274, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I''m freezing my ass of on this Saturday morning in Canada, so I''ll give it a 9.  Lovely composition.  Like the kids in the picture too.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I''m freezing my ass of on this Saturday morning in Canada, so I''ll give it a 9.  Lovely composition.  Like the kids in the picture too.', '2002-09-28 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130617, 6274, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ll trade you corners of the world!!  I''m quite jealous.  Oh... very nice shot, I might add :)</td>', 'I''ll trade you corners of the world!!  I''m quite jealous.  Oh... very nice shot, I might add :)', '2002-09-28 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130618, 6274, 2323, '<td valign="top">Ummm... do you have a room for rent? I want to live here, and I don''t take up much space! :-)  Seriously, this is a nice photo and you''ve done a good job of showing me what your "corner of the world" is like. 10 --sohr--</td>', 'Ummm... do you have a room for rent? I want to live here, and I don''t take up much space! :-)  Seriously, this is a nice photo and you''ve done a good job of showing me what your "corner of the world" is like. 10 --sohr--', '2002-09-29 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130619, 6275, 3102, '<td valign="top">It looks like you could have used a little smaller aperature to get a little more in focus on this one.  These are interesting-looking buildings, but the cars and street signs detract from the overall image.</td>', 'It looks like you could have used a little smaller aperature to get a little more in focus on this one.  These are interesting-looking buildings, but the cars and street signs detract from the overall image.', '2002-09-23 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130620, 6275, 3287, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a little soft</td>', 'Focus seems a little soft', '2002-09-23 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130621, 6275, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot of a lovely town. Nice job. Good luck. Justine Score 7</td>', 'Pretty shot of a lovely town. Nice job. Good luck. Justine Score 7', '2002-09-23 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130622, 6275, 3859, '<td valign="top">So  many  cars take away from the picture.  Make it feel too busy.  The street sign is a nice touch, however.</td>', 'So  many  cars take away from the picture.  Make it feel too busy.  The street sign is a nice touch, however.', '2002-09-24 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130623, 6275, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-24 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130624, 6275, 3317, '<td valign="top">a little boring.</td>', 'a little boring.', '2002-09-25 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130625, 6275, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems like a slightly odd angle, was that on purpose?  Focus isn''t bad, but seems like it could be a little sharper.  A tad busy......7 Swash</td>', 'Seems like a slightly odd angle, was that on purpose?  Focus isn''t bad, but seems like it could be a little sharper.  A tad busy......7 Swash', '2002-09-25 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130626, 6278, 1877, '<td valign="top">Hey.. where are the wings? ;) This is an interesting shot! You definitely get bravery points for getting that close to something that big. I love the horizon and the beautiful colors in the sky. 6</td>', 'Hey.. where are the wings? ;) This is an interesting shot! You definitely get bravery points for getting that close to something that big. I love the horizon and the beautiful colors in the sky. 6', '2002-09-23 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130627, 6278, 772, '<td valign="top">I love this photo... out of all the photos in the current challenge, I think that THIS one does the absolute BEST job of relaying to me what it feels like and looks like to be in ''your corner of the world''.  I don''t particularly like the haze off in the distance in this image.  A polarizer could possibly help this, but I love the image overall... This is probably, if not definitely, my favorite for the week... great shot and keep up the excellent work... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love this photo... out of all the photos in the current challenge, I think that THIS one does the absolute BEST job of relaying to me what it feels like and looks like to be in ''your corner of the world''.  I don''t particularly like the haze off in the distance in this image.  A polarizer could possibly help this, but I love the image overall... This is probably, if not definitely, my favorite for the week... great shot and keep up the excellent work... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-23 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130628, 6278, 327, '<td valign="top">I know your state well, one of my top five favorites. This is a good shot, really good. Love the colors. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'I know your state well, one of my top five favorites. This is a good shot, really good. Love the colors. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-23 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130629, 6278, 2295, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  Focus is outstanding.  It''s just a bit bright on the lighting, but not enough to ruin your 10.  I love the subject matter.  waltoml.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  Focus is outstanding.  It''s just a bit bright on the lighting, but not enough to ruin your 10.  I love the subject matter.  waltoml.', '2002-09-23 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130630, 6278, 2130, '<td valign="top">nice.....a10</td>', 'nice.....a10', '2002-09-23 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130631, 6278, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s been many years since I was in Wyoming (do ya know Meteetse??).  Terrific shot of the furry beasts and their domain. lhall-8</td>', 'Wow, it''s been many years since I was in Wyoming (do ya know Meteetse??).  Terrific shot of the furry beasts and their domain. lhall-8', '2002-09-23 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130632, 6278, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very nice location.  The picture is great. Maybe you could''ve move a little to get rid of some shadows, such as the one that is cast by the bone of the big buffalo.</td>', 'Very nice location.  The picture is great. Maybe you could''ve move a little to get rid of some shadows, such as the one that is cast by the bone of the big buffalo.', '2002-09-23 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130633, 6278, 3280, '<td valign="top">Oh, give me a home...actually it looks fairly desolate.  Nice shot, I hope you didn''t have to get too close to them.  I''ve been close and they can be scary.  Dpz</td>', 'Oh, give me a home...actually it looks fairly desolate.  Nice shot, I hope you didn''t have to get too close to them.  I''ve been close and they can be scary.  Dpz', '2002-09-23 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130634, 6278, 637, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love how you''ve got the animals in the foreground and the background.  7 sjgleah</td>', 'Very nice.  I love how you''ve got the animals in the foreground and the background.  7 sjgleah', '2002-09-24 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130635, 6278, 2781, '<td valign="top">oh wow!  Nice shot!  The horizon is a little crooked, but to me, it doesn''t ruin this shot.</td>', 'oh wow!  Nice shot!  The horizon is a little crooked, but to me, it doesn''t ruin this shot.', '2002-09-24 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130636, 6278, 2792, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent, excellent!!!!!!!</td>', 'Excellent, excellent, excellent!!!!!!!', '2002-09-24 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130637, 6278, 3447, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus.  Big country.                  JEM</td>', 'Sharp focus.  Big country.                  JEM', '2002-09-24 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130638, 6278, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  (A bit breezy, yes?)  more bison face might have been nice, but that''s a nit!  10 Swash</td>', 'Really nice.  (A bit breezy, yes?)  more bison face might have been nice, but that''s a nit!  10 Swash', '2002-09-24 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130639, 6278, 3035, '<td valign="top">my eye says light, cast, wash - but the subject is so cool and the capture so nice!  what happens when u get so close?  I can only imagine!  lol!  great shot.  8 sgtpepper6344</td>', 'my eye says light, cast, wash - but the subject is so cool and the capture so nice!  what happens when u get so close?  I can only imagine!  lol!  great shot.  8 sgtpepper6344', '2002-09-24 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
