(130641, 6278, 1904, '<td valign="top">Wow, somebody else from Wyoming, or were you just driving through?</td>', 'Wow, somebody else from Wyoming, or were you just driving through?', '2002-09-25 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130642, 6278, 1829, '<td valign="top">Buffalo, now that''s something rare in my Country.  Fantastic capture, colour and DOF.  I scored this beauty a 9.</td>', 'Buffalo, now that''s something rare in my Country.  Fantastic capture, colour and DOF.  I scored this beauty a 9.', '2002-09-25 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130643, 6278, 3730, '<td valign="top">I think this is an awsome shot, and I am giving it a high vote. Good luck.</td>', 'I think this is an awsome shot, and I am giving it a high vote. Good luck.', '2002-09-25 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130644, 6278, 1897, '<td valign="top">interesting, well composed shot.</td>', 'interesting, well composed shot.', '2002-09-25 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130645, 6278, 3112, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Darken and boost contrast, but just a bit. 8</td>', 'Yes!  Darken and boost contrast, but just a bit. 8', '2002-09-25 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130646, 6278, 3932, '<td valign="top">Wow... That''s awesome that you were able to capture this.  The picture, in it''s entirety works very well.  I like the first buffalo being as close as it is - you can imagine the size of the animal... But the rest of the picture makes you realize just how "small" it really is :)  Very nice shot... 8   - JB</td>', 'Wow... That''s awesome that you were able to capture this.  The picture, in it''s entirety works very well.  I like the first buffalo being as close as it is - you can imagine the size of the animal... But the rest of the picture makes you realize just how "small" it really is :)  Very nice shot... 8   - JB', '2002-09-25 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130647, 6278, 1569, '<td valign="top">Great photo---every time I look at it I get lost in it.Exellent pix!!</td>', 'Great photo---every time I look at it I get lost in it.Exellent pix!!', '2002-09-25 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130648, 6278, 656, '<td valign="top">needs a flatter horizon if possible.  you''ve done well to be so close and then I like that there are more in the middle distance.</td>', 'needs a flatter horizon if possible.  you''ve done well to be so close and then I like that there are more in the middle distance.', '2002-09-26 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130649, 6278, 1543, '<td valign="top">love the dof and details.</td>', 'love the dof and details.', '2002-09-26 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130650, 6278, 3902, '<td valign="top">Wow...</td>', 'Wow...', '2002-09-26 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130651, 6278, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=excellent<br/>Composition=great! buffalo on the left in one of the thirds, and looking right. Other animals lead eye into the photo. Shows the expansiveness of the area<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=excellent. details extend into the distance.<br/>Exposure=well done. colors and lighting are true front and back and into the sky<br/>Interesting or Emotive=interesting and emotive.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/><br/>Side note: Will you have a chance, or have you done so before... to photograph these in the snow?<br/></td>', 'Initial=excellentComposition=great! buffalo on the left in one of the thirds, and looking right. Other animals lead eye into the photo. Shows the expansiveness of the areaClarity (focus, details)=excellent. details extend into the distance.Exposure=well done. colors and lighting are true front and back and into the skyInteresting or Emotive=interesting and emotive.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpbSide note: Will you have a chance, or have you done so before... to photograph these in the snow?', '2002-09-26 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130652, 6278, 4057, '<td valign="top">I originally gave a nine...feeling more liberal on second thought..so a big 10.</td>', 'I originally gave a nine...feeling more liberal on second thought..so a big 10.', '2002-09-26 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130653, 6278, 2223, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!! 9--shutterfly</td>', 'beautiful shot!! 9--shutterfly', '2002-09-27 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130654, 6278, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptionally beautiful photograph. I get a real sense of place from this. Very nice use of dawn (or maybe dusk, but I suspect not) light to capture all the details of the fur and grass so well without too many harsh shadows. It seems as though it needs rotating slightly in the counter-clockwise direction to line up that horizon properly, but nonetheless  I''m giving this 10 - lisae</td>', 'This is an exceptionally beautiful photograph. I get a real sense of place from this. Very nice use of dawn (or maybe dusk, but I suspect not) light to capture all the details of the fur and grass so well without too many harsh shadows. It seems as though it needs rotating slightly in the counter-clockwise direction to line up that horizon properly, but nonetheless  I''m giving this 10 - lisae', '2002-09-28 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130655, 6278, 4239, '<td valign="top">nice country</td>', 'nice country', '2002-09-28 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130656, 6278, 2667, '<td valign="top">I have a fondness for buffalo and this is a great shot of ''em!  you have captured WY to a tee for me with the endless horizon and subtle variations in the colors. great composition.</td>', 'I have a fondness for buffalo and this is a great shot of ''em!  you have captured WY to a tee for me with the endless horizon and subtle variations in the colors. great composition.', '2002-09-28 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130657, 6278, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ha -- I KNEW that was going to be the title before I even saw it!  Great shot, beautiful landscape!</td>', 'Ha -- I KNEW that was going to be the title before I even saw it!  Great shot, beautiful landscape!', '2002-09-28 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130658, 6278, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 10,<br/>Total Averaged Rating10.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 10,Total Averaged Rating10.   Autool', '2002-09-29 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130659, 6278, 3506, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but that guy need food!</td>', 'Great shot, but that guy need food!', '2002-09-29 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130660, 6278, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think a polarizer would have helped the sky color.  7 nards656<br/></td>', 'I think a polarizer would have helped the sky color.  7 nards656', '2002-09-29 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130661, 6278, 3136, '<td valign="top">I hope the buffalo didn''t charge you after this shot was taken....Nice job...Interesting picture and insight into your corner of the world in Wyoming...Good luck! 8 johnson</td>', 'I hope the buffalo didn''t charge you after this shot was taken....Nice job...Interesting picture and insight into your corner of the world in Wyoming...Good luck! 8 johnson', '2002-09-29 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130662, 6278, 3260, '<td valign="top">I was in Wyoming last month. Amazing locations for good pictures. Good job!</td>', 'I was in Wyoming last month. Amazing locations for good pictures. Good job!', '2002-09-30 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130663, 6278, 714, '<td valign="top">Thanks GatorCB, Great for landscapes, but not for reflections.  :)</td>', 'Thanks GatorCB, Great for landscapes, but not for reflections.  :)', '2002-09-30 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130664, 6278, 2204, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the peacefulness in this photo. It makes me a little home sick.  <br/> I was born and raised in Eastern Oregon and visited a buffalo ranch often.  I don''t know the size of the ranch in your picture but the one in Oregon was a bit over 5000 head.  We would often drive out to watch them at feeding time in the morning and evening.  I took a semi tractor-trailer full of hay each morning and each evening to keep them fed.  <br/>I thought sure it would be in the top 3 this week but, I can''t fault the photos that did take the first 3 places.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'I LOVE the peacefulness in this photo. It makes me a little home sick.   I was born and raised in Eastern Oregon and visited a buffalo ranch often.  I don''t know the size of the ranch in your picture but the one in Oregon was a bit over 5000 head.  We would often drive out to watch them at feeding time in the morning and evening.  I took a semi tractor-trailer full of hay each morning and each evening to keep them fed.  I thought sure it would be in the top 3 this week but, I can''t fault the photos that did take the first 3 places.Congratulations.', '2002-10-06 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(130665, 6279, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on this one!</td>', 'Nice colors on this one!', '2002-09-23 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130666, 6279, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty building, you did this well. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Pretty building, you did this well. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-23 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130667, 6279, 3461, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light. Would it be possible to reshoot from a different angle to see the cross at the top straight on?</td>', 'Wonderful light. Would it be possible to reshoot from a different angle to see the cross at the top straight on?', '2002-09-23 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
