(130758, 6287, 656, '<td valign="top">wish the horizon line/ front of the barn was horizontal - it annoys me as soon as I look at this.  The colours of the barn are great, working well with the green/ blue of the sky.<br/><br/>It might be interesting to reshoot this barn and get a whole lot closer in if you can, and just isolate segments of it.  Not sure if that is possible for you or not.  A promising subject. - Gordon</td>', 'wish the horizon line/ front of the barn was horizontal - it annoys me as soon as I look at this.  The colours of the barn are great, working well with the green/ blue of the sky.It might be interesting to reshoot this barn and get a whole lot closer in if you can, and just isolate segments of it.  Not sure if that is possible for you or not.  A promising subject. - Gordon', '2002-09-26 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
