(130781, 6289, 2923, '<td valign="top">i think the skyline is a bit over exposed, losing details on the clouds, typical effect of failure of most automatic metering system (it attempts to average to get middle gray but since the skyline is darker, it opens the sutter a bit too much by probably 1/2 stops here). 6</td>', 'i think the skyline is a bit over exposed, losing details on the clouds, typical effect of failure of most automatic metering system (it attempts to average to get middle gray but since the skyline is darker, it opens the sutter a bit too much by probably 1/2 stops here). 6', '2002-09-25 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
