(130787, 6289, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo... these clouds are just about perfect :)  The family with the dogs on the beach is also a very nice touch.  this photo would not be the same without it :)  = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful photo... these clouds are just about perfect :)  The family with the dogs on the beach is also a very nice touch.  this photo would not be the same without it :)  = 10 - setzler', '2002-09-26 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
