(130795, 6289, 312, '<td valign="top">thanks to everyone for their comments this week. this was not the original concept i was going for when i ventured down to the beach. i got a decent shot of that concept, but decided to post this shot instead because i just thought it had a calmer, prettier feel. i was sitting on the beach taking a lot of shots and was very happy to see this family walking by against the sunset.<br/><br/>paganini - i took about 100 shots that day, all in full manual mode. so if it''s overexposed, that''s my fault. i don''t see it as overexposed, but it IS very tough to balance the dark beach and sillhouettes with a very bright sun.<br/><br/>shot with a polarizing and uv filter. leveled and maybe some curves in photoshop, can''t remember.</td>', 'thanks to everyone for their comments this week. this was not the original concept i was going for when i ventured down to the beach. i got a decent shot of that concept, but decided to post this shot instead because i just thought it had a calmer, prettier feel. i was sitting on the beach taking a lot of shots and was very happy to see this family walking by against the sunset.paganini - i took about 100 shots that day, all in full manual mode. so if it''s overexposed, that''s my fault. i don''t see it as overexposed, but it IS very tough to balance the dark beach and sillhouettes with a very bright sun.shot with a polarizing and uv filter. leveled and maybe some curves in photoshop, can''t remember.', '2002-09-30 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
