(130804, 6290, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo... I would love to hear some commentary on how this is ''your corner of the world'' :)  I sorta like squirrels too.  I feed them on my back porch year round.  I have learned some lessons about what kinds of bird feeders to buy also :)  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a really neat photo... I would love to hear some commentary on how this is ''your corner of the world'' :)  I sorta like squirrels too.  I feed them on my back porch year round.  I have learned some lessons about what kinds of bird feeders to buy also :)  - jmsetzler', '2002-09-23 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
