(130806, 6290, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot really makes me smile every time I look at it!  I don''t mind that he is in the center of the shot - there are all kinds of lines and angles going on and there he is right on top of the curves - lots to look at, but your eye always comes back to him (or her). lhall-8</td>', 'This shot really makes me smile every time I look at it!  I don''t mind that he is in the center of the shot - there are all kinds of lines and angles going on and there he is right on top of the curves - lots to look at, but your eye always comes back to him (or her). lhall-8', '2002-09-24 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(130807, 6290, 2295, '<td valign="top">Love that squirrel.  This is a great photo.  Focus is good.,  Lighting is good.  9 waltoml</td>', 'Love that squirrel.  This is a great photo.  Focus is good.,  Lighting is good.  9 waltoml', '2002-09-24 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
