(131043, 6305, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting - perhaps a little bit soft/ blurred though, was it a hand-held shot ?  Tripods make things like this a whole lot easier to get them really sharp.  Unsure compositionally what you are trying to do - the lines shoot me straight out of the top of the shot - maybe the whole neck would have given me somewhere to stop ?</td>', 'I like the lighting - perhaps a little bit soft/ blurred though, was it a hand-held shot ?  Tripods make things like this a whole lot easier to get them really sharp.  Unsure compositionally what you are trying to do - the lines shoot me straight out of the top of the shot - maybe the whole neck would have given me somewhere to stop ?', '2002-09-23 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
