(131194, 6315, 656, '<td valign="top">Well framed within the frame.  This can be a bit of a cliche but it suits this shot as a ''window on the world.   I think I''d almost prefer it without the moon, partly because of the flare, but you''ve used it to good effect to establish the time of day.  <br/><br/>Certainly it being dusk/ morning makes the colours take on a surreal, almost comic book cast and somehow it looks like a model town. - Gordon</td>', 'Well framed within the frame.  This can be a bit of a cliche but it suits this shot as a ''window on the world.   I think I''d almost prefer it without the moon, partly because of the flare, but you''ve used it to good effect to establish the time of day.  Certainly it being dusk/ morning makes the colours take on a surreal, almost comic book cast and somehow it looks like a model town. - Gordon', '2002-09-26 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
