(131225, 6316, 3035, '<td valign="top">must be the local name for the mtn?  lol!  I am not a mtn freak but this is a great shot and sight to see!  I get the sense of space and location you encourage with the fencepost and like this pic alot!  8 sgtpepper6344</td>', 'must be the local name for the mtn?  lol!  I am not a mtn freak but this is a great shot and sight to see!  I get the sense of space and location you encourage with the fencepost and like this pic alot!  8 sgtpepper6344', '2002-09-24 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131226, 6316, 3532, '<td valign="top">I would  have prefered to see the post slightly more off center.  Right now it''s almost dead on, and almost lined up with the mountain peak.  I think it would have been more interesting to have some focal point off to one side</td>', 'I would  have prefered to see the post slightly more off center.  Right now it''s almost dead on, and almost lined up with the mountain peak.  I think it would have been more interesting to have some focal point off to one side', '2002-09-25 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131227, 6316, 1829, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo.  I especially like the mountain with the snow on it.  I also like the fact that you didn''t use to much ''sky'' space and used more of the greenery to bring out this photo.  I love it - 9 :)  Good luck in the Challenge.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo.  I especially like the mountain with the snow on it.  I also like the fact that you didn''t use to much ''sky'' space and used more of the greenery to bring out this photo.  I love it - 9 :)  Good luck in the Challenge.', '2002-09-25 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
