(131231, 6316, 2983, '<td valign="top">The mountain is beautiful, the fence post is too much of a contrast, and is distracting.  I think you just have a balance issue here.  Maybe try two shots, one of the fence post, on on the other side of it at the mountain, and I''ll bet you''ll have two great shots.</td>', 'The mountain is beautiful, the fence post is too much of a contrast, and is distracting.  I think you just have a balance issue here.  Maybe try two shots, one of the fence post, on on the other side of it at the mountain, and I''ll bet you''ll have two great shots.', '2002-09-26 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131232, 6316, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Focus and lighting are good.  I like the subject matter.  8 waltoml</td>', 'Very nice image.  Focus and lighting are good.  I like the subject matter.  8 waltoml', '2002-09-26 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
