(131236, 6316, 3178, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good composition - foreground / background. Possibly a little too close to fense. And if possible, you might want to try this shot with a neutral density filter or polorizer to deepen the exposure on the sky. Pretty shot, though, and meets the challenge. chrisab.</td>', 'Nice. Good composition - foreground / background. Possibly a little too close to fense. And if possible, you might want to try this shot with a neutral density filter or polorizer to deepen the exposure on the sky. Pretty shot, though, and meets the challenge. chrisab.', '2002-09-28 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131237, 6316, 3669, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo.  Too bad it wasn''t a clearer day with a nice blue sky.  None the less, I give it a 10.  I''ll be anxious to find out where this is.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo.  Too bad it wasn''t a clearer day with a nice blue sky.  None the less, I give it a 10.  I''ll be anxious to find out where this is.', '2002-09-28 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
