(131250, 6317, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I like how the road shines.  The person in the middle seems fuzzy to me.  I like the lighting.  Meets the challenge.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Very interesting.  I like how the road shines.  The person in the middle seems fuzzy to me.  I like the lighting.  Meets the challenge.  6 waltoml.', '2002-09-25 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131251, 6317, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea, I am guessing, but I think the post processing might be overly done.  Along the bricks to the left of the silhouette, seem blotchy colored.  This might been partly due to the sun reflection, but it hurts the shot''s effectiveness.<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Really neat idea, I am guessing, but I think the post processing might be overly done.  Along the bricks to the left of the silhouette, seem blotchy colored.  This might been partly due to the sun reflection, but it hurts the shot''s effectiveness.7 Swash', '2002-09-25 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131252, 6317, 3996, '<td valign="top">The photo seems to have some problem, It''s visible some compression(?)/blurred parts. The composition is very good.</td>', 'The photo seems to have some problem, It''s visible some compression(?)/blurred parts. The composition is very good.', '2002-09-25 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
