(131254, 6317, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t compressed this so much.  I really like the shot.</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t compressed this so much.  I really like the shot.', '2002-09-25 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131255, 6317, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool image... I love what I see here.. this image definitely has some compression issues.  there is a lot of detail loss because of that... however, the lack of detail here... this has a nice surreal look to it... I would love to see the original on this one and help figger out what may have happened... = 8 - setzler</td>', 'This is a really cool image... I love what I see here.. this image definitely has some compression issues.  there is a lot of detail loss because of that... however, the lack of detail here... this has a nice surreal look to it... I would love to see the original on this one and help figger out what may have happened... = 8 - setzler', '2002-09-25 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131256, 6317, 3419, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little too dark around the edges for my taste. Is this a safe place to be?</td>', 'This photo is a little too dark around the edges for my taste. Is this a safe place to be?', '2002-09-26 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131257, 6317, 656, '<td valign="top">could be good - looks like it might have been, but you''ve over compressed it and saved it too small (notice all the large blocks, particularly in the dark areas)  Hopefully you can get some hints on how to avoid this in the future (please contact me if you want some advice ) Gordon</td>', 'could be good - looks like it might have been, but you''ve over compressed it and saved it too small (notice all the large blocks, particularly in the dark areas)  Hopefully you can get some hints on how to avoid this in the future (please contact me if you want some advice ) Gordon', '2002-09-26 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131258, 6317, 2983, '<td valign="top">Big compression problem here.  It''s only 12k, you can go up to 150k!  It might be a camera limitation though.  This would be very good if it weren''t overcompressed.</td>', 'Big compression problem here.  It''s only 12k, you can go up to 150k!  It might be a camera limitation though.  This would be very good if it weren''t overcompressed.', '2002-09-26 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131259, 6317, 2857, '<td valign="top">cool shot. too bad the resolution is so low.</td>', 'cool shot. too bad the resolution is so low.', '2002-09-26 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131260, 6317, 4057, '<td valign="top">Unfocused...I am also sorry that you live in an alley.......maybe things will improve,I sure hope so.I will pray for you.</td>', 'Unfocused...I am also sorry that you live in an alley.......maybe things will improve,I sure hope so.I will pray for you.', '2002-09-26 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
