(131262, 6317, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot more, now that I have looked at it several times.  My first impression was just "dark".  I like the composition and the fact that the shadow of the person is prominent.  lhall-6</td>', 'I like this shot more, now that I have looked at it several times.  My first impression was just "dark".  I like the composition and the fact that the shadow of the person is prominent.  lhall-6', '2002-09-27 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
