(131272, 6320, 2130, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better if it was darker...almost black...and without the "A" but the lighting just comes down to taste....it is a nice one</td>', 'I would have liked it better if it was darker...almost black...and without the "A" but the lighting just comes down to taste....it is a nice one', '2002-09-23 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
