(131452, 6329, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=interesting geometrics<br/>Composition=like how the red triangle points up to the shelves above, which are also in a triangular position<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=Starts out well from the bottom, but due to the darkness at the top, the image becomes dithered. Perhaps some lighting at the top of the shelf would eleviate this.<br/>Exposure=fair<br/>Interesting or Emotive=the geometrics are interesting, but the plastic bag stops my eye from continuing to the top. The other items on the shelf are fine.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/>kpb<br/></td>', 'Initial=interesting geometricsComposition=like how the red triangle points up to the shelves above, which are also in a triangular positionClarity (focus, details)=Starts out well from the bottom, but due to the darkness at the top, the image becomes dithered. Perhaps some lighting at the top of the shelf would eleviate this.Exposure=fairInteresting or Emotive=the geometrics are interesting, but the plastic bag stops my eye from continuing to the top. The other items on the shelf are fine.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it more helpful than my former comments.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)kpb', '2002-09-29 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
