(131462, 6330, 3818, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny! The crop is a little too funky, though...think it would have been better to leave in the top of the hydrant and a little bit more of the dog (though I don''t mind cropping him in half...but there''s just not enough of him to really make this crop work). The grass and sidewalk overpower the pic, when you want the dog and hydrant to be the main focus. I like funky shots and odd crops, but this is a tad too *odd* to really work as well as it could...though it''s purty darn close!</td>', 'Pretty funny! The crop is a little too funky, though...think it would have been better to leave in the top of the hydrant and a little bit more of the dog (though I don''t mind cropping him in half...but there''s just not enough of him to really make this crop work). The grass and sidewalk overpower the pic, when you want the dog and hydrant to be the main focus. I like funky shots and odd crops, but this is a tad too *odd* to really work as well as it could...though it''s purty darn close!', '2002-09-24 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
